msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: RGN0_004
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 燃え盛る火炎。
#. JA:   跡形もなく崩れ落ちていく小さな教会。
msgctxt "RGN0_004"
msgid ""
"The flames continue to rise.\n"
"What remains of a tiny church is burning to the ground."
msgstr ""
"Полум'я здіймається дедалі вище. Від маленької церкви майже нічого не\n"
"лишилося — вона догорає вщент."

#. Key: RGN0_005
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 腕の中で微かに息をする妹。
#. JA:   目の前に立って微笑を浮かべている弟。
#. JA: 
#. JA:   腕の中で微かに息をする妹。
#. JA:   目の前に立って微笑を浮かべている弟。
msgctxt "RGN0_005"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Cradled in my arms, my little sister is barely breathing,\n"
"and my little brother stands smiling before me."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"У мене на руках ледве дихає молодша сестра, а переді мною стоїть і\n"
"всміхається молодший брат."

#. Key: RGN0_006
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 何の前触れもなく突如やってきた無慈悲な出来事。
#. JA:   自分には思考する猶予さえ許されない。
#. JA: 
#. JA:   何の前触れもなく突如やってきた無慈悲な出来事。
#. JA:   自分には思考する猶予さえ許されない。
msgctxt "RGN0_006"
msgid ""
"\n"
"It struck without warning.\n"
"I had no time to figure out what was going on."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Це сталося без жодного попередження. Я не мав часу навіть зрозуміти,\n"
"що коїться."

#. Key: RGN0_007
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 全てが破壊され、奪われていく。
#. JA:   自分に出来ることは、ただひたすらに叫ぶことだけ。
#. JA: 
#. JA:   全てが破壊され、奪われていく。
#. JA:   自分にできることは、ただひたすらに叫ぶことだけ。
msgctxt "RGN0_007"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Everything and everyone I care about is taken from me."
msgstr "\nУ мене забрали все і всіх, хто був мені дорогий."

#. Key: RGN0_008
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: わからないわからないわからない―――――
#. JA:   どうすればいい？　どうしたい？　どうするべきなのか？
#. JA:   今の自分には、何も、できない。
msgctxt "RGN0_008"
msgid ""
"Why...? I don't understand. Why did this happen?\n"
"What should I do? What can I do? What could I have done?\n"
"The way I am now, I can do...nothing."
msgstr ""
"Чому...? Я не розумію. Чому це сталося? Що мені робити? Що я можу?\n"
"Що мав зробити? Такий, як зараз, я не можу... нічого."

#. Key: RGN0_009
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 突きつけられた現実も。
#. JA:   当前のように享受してきた日常の脆さも。
#. JA:   己の無力さも。
#. JA: 
#. JA:   突きつけられた現実も。
#. JA:   当たり前のように享受してきた日常の脆さも。
#. JA:   己の無力さも。
msgctxt "RGN0_009"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Reality finally sets in. The cold, harsh truth.\n"
"I had taken my life for granted, and I am powerless to preserve it."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Нарешті я усвідомлюю дійсність. Холодну й жорстоку правду. Я\n"
"сприймав своє життя як належне, а тепер не маю сили його захистити."

#. Key: RGN0_010
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 全てが憎い。
#. JA: 
#. JA:   ―――全てが憎い。
msgctxt "RGN0_010"
msgid ""
"\n"
"That was when I learned to hate everything."
msgstr "\nТоді я й навчився ненавидіти все."

#. Key: RGN0_015
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ったく、面倒くせぇなぁ――――
#. JA: 「ったく、面倒くせぇなぁ―――」
msgctxt "RGN0_015"
msgid "<DQ>Geez, what a drag...<DQ>"
msgstr "«Тьху, яка морока...»"

#. Key: RGN0_017
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 柔らかい芝生の上にごろんと寝転がり、空を見上げる。
#. JA:   降り注ぐ木漏れ日が心地よい。
#. JA:   未だ、水桶は空のまま、川べりに転がっている。
#. JA: 柔らかい芝生の上にごろんと寝転がり、空を見上げた。
#. JA:   降り注ぐ木漏れ日が心地よい。
#. JA:   未だ水桶は空のまま、川べりに転がっている。
msgctxt "RGN0_017"
msgid ""
"I'm lying on the soft grass of the field, gazing up at the sky.\n"
"Dappled sunlight shines through the trees, casting a patchwork of shadows across the\n"
"empty bucket sitting at the riverbank."
msgstr ""
"Я лежу на м'якій траві й дивлюся в небо. Сонячне проміння\n"
"пробивається крізь листя, вкриваючи клаптиками тіней порожнє відро\n"
"на березі річки."

#. Key: RGN0_018
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: このまま昼寝しちまおう―――――瞼を閉じかけたところでシスターの鬼の形相が浮かんで慌てて眼を見開く。
#. JA: このまま昼寝しちまおうか―――――
#. JA:   瞼を閉じかけたところでシスターの鬼の形相が浮かんで慌てて目を見開いた。
msgctxt "RGN0_018"
msgid ""
"...Should I take a nap?\n"
"I let my eyes drift shut, but a memory of those fiendish nuns floats in my head.\n"
"Not a second passes before I open my eyes again."
msgstr ""
"...Може, подрімати? Я вже заплющую очі, та в голові спливає образ\n"
"розлючених черниць. Не минає й секунди, як я знову їх розплющую."

#. Key: RGN0_019
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: この前なんか馬鹿丁寧に時間測ってたしな。
#. JA:   ったく、んなことする暇があるなら自分でいけっての
#. JA: 「この前なんか馬鹿丁寧に時間測ってたしな。
#. JA:   　ったく、んなことする暇があるなら自分でいけっての」
msgctxt "RGN0_019"
msgid ""
"<DQ>I can't believe they tried to time me the other day.\n"
" Geez, if they have that kind of time, why don't they try and get it themselves?<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"«Не віриться, що минулого разу вони навіть час засікали. Якщо мають\n"
"на це час, то чому самі не принесуть воду?»"

#. Key: RGN0_020
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……そういや、今日は珍しくあいつがおとなしかったな。
#. JA: 「……そういや、今日は珍しくアイツが大人しかったな」
msgctxt "RGN0_020"
msgid "<DQ>...Speaking of which, he was pretty quiet today.<DQ>"
msgstr "«...До речі, сьогодні він був напрочуд тихим.»"

#. Key: RGN0_021
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: いつもいつもムカつくほどに「兄さんと一緒にやる」とか駄々こねてうるせぇくせに――――今日に限っては妙に静かだった。
#. JA: いつもいつもムカつくほどに「兄さんと一緒にやる」とか
#. JA:   駄々こねてうるせぇくせに―――今日に限っては妙に静かだった。
msgctxt "RGN0_021"
msgid ""
"The boy's never satisfied, always giving me that <DQ>I wanna go with brother<DQ>\n"
"nonsense...but I haven't heard a peep out of him today."
msgstr ""
"Йому завжди мало, постійно ниє: «Хочу піти з братиком»... А сьогодні від\n"
"нього ані звуку."

#. Key: RGN0_022
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 何かあったんだろうか？
#. JA:   あいつも少しずつ成長している、そういうことなのか？
#. JA: 何かあったんだろうか？
#. JA:   アイツも少しずつ成長している、そういうことなのか？
msgctxt "RGN0_022"
msgid ""
"Is something bothering him, or is he finally starting to grow up?\n"
"I hope that's the case."
msgstr ""
"Його щось турбує чи він нарешті починає дорослішати? Сподіваюся,\n"
"друге."

#. Key: RGN0_023
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 最近は妹の具合が悪かったせいもあるが、あいつに構ってやる暇が無かった。
#. JA: ここのところ、妹の具合が悪かったせいもあるが、アイツに構ってやる暇がなかった。
msgctxt "RGN0_023"
msgid "Our sister's been so sick lately, I haven't been spending as much time with him."
msgstr "Останнім часом сестра дуже хворіє, тож я майже не приділяв йому уваги."

#. Key: RGN0_024
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: しゃーねーな、帰ったら少しだけ遊んでやるかっ――――
#. JA: 「しゃーねーな、帰ったら少しだけ遊んでやるかっ―――」
msgctxt "RGN0_024"
msgid "<DQ>Oh well, I guess I'll play with 'im when I get home.<DQ>"
msgstr "«Гаразд, повернуся додому — трохи з ним пограюся.»"

#. Key: RGN0_027
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 軽やかに体を起こし、水桶を手に取っる。
#. JA:   そのまま乱暴に川へ突っ込んで水を汲んだ。
#. JA: 軽やかに体を起こし、水桶を手に取る。
#. JA:   そのまま乱暴に川へ突っ込んで水を汲んだ。
msgctxt "RGN0_027"
msgid ""
"With renewed vigor, I jump to my feet and grab my bucket.\n"
"Violently swinging it through the river, I fill the pail with fresh water."
msgstr ""
"Сповнений нових сил, я підхоплююся й беру відро. Різко занурюю його в\n"
"річку й набираю свіжої води."

#. Key: RGN0_028
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: よし。さっさと、帰っか！
#. JA: 
#. JA:   「よし。さっさと、帰っか！」
msgctxt "RGN0_028"
msgid ""
"\n"
"<DQ>All right. Time to head home!<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"«Гаразд. Час додому!»"

#. Key: RGN0_030
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ！？　何だ――――？
#. JA: 「!?　何だ―――？」
msgctxt "RGN0_030"
msgid "<DQ>!?   What the—<DQ>"
msgstr "«!? Що за—»"

#. Key: RGN0_032
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おい、マジかよっ？！
#. JA: 
#. JA:   「おい、マジかよっ!?」
msgctxt "RGN0_032"
msgid ""
"\n"
"<DQ>Are you kidding me!?<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"«Ви знущаєтеся!?»"

#. Key: RGN0_034
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 水桶を投げ捨て、走り出す。
#. JA: 無造作に水桶を投げ捨て、走り出していた。
msgctxt "RGN0_034"
msgid "I toss the bucket aside and begin to run."
msgstr "Я відкидаю відро й кидаюся бігти."

#. Key: RGN0_037
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: か、火事か！？
#. JA: 「か、火事か!?」
msgctxt "RGN0_037"
msgid "<DQ>A...A fire!?<DQ>"
msgstr "«П-пожежа!?»"

#. Key: RGN0_039
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……教会がぐちゃぐちゃだ。
#. JA:   何があったんだ？　――――皆は！？
#. JA: 「はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……教会がぐちゃぐちゃだ。
#. JA:   　何があったんだ？　―――皆は!?」
msgctxt "RGN0_039"
msgid ""
"<DQ>Haah, haah, haah...the church...it's—\n"
" What happened? Is everyone...!?<DQ>"
msgstr "«Ха-а, ха-а, ха-а... церква... вона— Що сталося? Де всі...!?»"

#. Key: RGN0_041
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 教会は激しく炎上し、屋根や壁が崩れ落ちかけている。
#. JA:   動転する気を抑え、周囲に目を走らせる。
#. JA:   
#. JA:   教会の傍らに、人影が見える―――妹だ。
#. JA:   すぐさま駆け寄り、その細い体を起こす。
#. JA:   
msgctxt "RGN0_041"
msgid ""
"The church, burning to the ground. Walls, crumbling.\n"
"Trying to suppress his emotions, he skims the area.\n"
"\n"
"He sees a person's shadow on the floor—his little sister.\n"
"He desperately rushes to the slender body and holds her.\n"
msgstr ""
"Церква палає, її стіни осипаються. Намагаючись опанувати себе, він\n"
"швидко оглядає все довкола.\n"
"\n"
"На землі видніється чиясь постать — його молодша сестра. Він\n"
"відчайдушно кидається до тендітного тіла й піднімає її.\n"

#. Key: RGN0_042
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おい！　大丈夫か！？　しっかりしろ！！
#. JA: 「おい！　大丈夫か!?　しっかりしろ！！」
msgctxt "RGN0_042"
msgid "<DQ>Hey! Are you all right!? Wake up!<DQ>"
msgstr "«Гей! Ти мене чуєш!? Отямся!»"

#. Key: RGN0_043
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: う、うう……。
#. JA: 「う、うう……」
msgctxt "RGN0_043"
msgid "<DQ>Ung...ugh...<DQ>"
msgstr "«Кх... у-у...»"

#. Key: RGN0_044
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: よかった……生きてるか。
#. JA: 「よかった……生きてるか」
msgctxt "RGN0_044"
msgid "<DQ>Thank God...you're alive...<DQ>"
msgstr "«Слава богу... ти жива...»"

#. Key: RGN0_045
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: クソッ、ジンとばあさんはどこだ！？
#. JA:   ちくしょう！！　なんなんだよ、
#. JA:   何があったんだよ、一体！！
#. JA: 
#. JA:   「クソッ、ジンとばあさんはどこだ!?
#. JA:   　ちくしょう！！　なんなんだよ、何があったんだよ、一体！！」
msgctxt "RGN0_045"
msgid ""
"<DQ>Damn it, where the hell are Jin and the old hag!?\n"
" Shit! What's going on? What the hell happened here!?<DQ>"
msgstr "«Чорт, де Джін і стара!? Лайно! Що тут коїться? Що, в біса, сталося!?»"

#. Key: RGN0_048
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 兄さん
#. JA: 「……兄さん」
msgctxt "RGN0_048"
msgid "<DQ>Ragna...<DQ>"
msgstr "«Братику...»"

#. Key: RGN0_049
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 顔は影で見えない。
#. JA: 
#. JA:   目の前に弟らしき姿があった。
#. JA:   立ち昇る煙に遮られ、表情は判然としない。
msgctxt "RGN0_049"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Is...Is that Jin?\n"
"I only see a silhouette. I can't see his face."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Це... Джін? Я бачу лише силует. Обличчя не розгледіти."

#. Key: RGN0_050
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……！？
#. JA:   ジン、おい無事か！？　一体、なにがあったんだよ！
#. JA: 「……!?
#. JA:   　ジン、おい無事か!?　一体、なにがあったんだよ！」
msgctxt "RGN0_050"
msgid ""
"\n"
"<DQ>...!?\n"
" Jin, are you OK!? What the hell happened!?<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"«...!? Джіне, ти цілий!? Що тут сталося!?»"

#. Key: RGN0_051
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ははっ……
#. JA: 「ははっ……」
msgctxt "RGN0_051"
msgid ""
"\n"
"<DQ>Hahah...<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"«Ха-ха...»"

#. Key: RGN0_052
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 三日月のように唇が歪む。
#. JA: 弟の口元が三日月のように歪んだ。
msgctxt "RGN0_052"
msgid ""
"\n"
"A sick smile escapes my brother's lips."
msgstr "Губи мого брата розтягуються в моторошній усмішці."

#. Key: RGN0_053
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: え？
#. JA: 「え？」
msgctxt "RGN0_053"
msgid "<DQ>Huh?<DQ>"
msgstr "«Га?»"

#. Key: RGN0_056
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ぐぁあっ！！
#. JA: 「ぐぁあっ！！」
msgctxt "RGN0_056"
msgid "<DQ>Uargh!<DQ>"
msgstr "«А-а-аргх!»"

#. Key: RGN0_057
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 一瞬、何が起きたのか分からなかった。
#. JA:   目の前に立ち口元を歪ませて微笑みを浮かべる弟と
#. JA:   床に落ちた「何か」に交互に視線を走らせる。
#. JA: 目の前に立ち口元を歪ませる弟の表情と、床に落ちた“何か”に交互に視線を走らせる。
msgctxt "RGN0_057"
msgid "I don't know what's going on at first, but I notice something roll on the ground."
msgstr ""
"Спершу я не розумію, що сталося, але помічаю, як щось котиться по\n"
"землі."

#. Key: RGN0_058
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 弟は、微動だにせず、ただひたすらに微笑を浮かべている。
#. JA: 弟は身じろぎもせず、静かに微笑を浮かべている。
msgctxt "RGN0_058"
msgid "My brother quietly smiles where he stands."
msgstr "Мій брат стоїть нерухомо й мовчки всміхається."

#. Key: RGN0_059
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: すぐ傍の床に転がっている「何か」は、まるで作り物のようだった。
#. JA:   その断面の生々しい赤さえもが、どこかの安いホラー映画で使われた
#. JA:   玩具のように偽物じみて見えた。
#. JA: すぐ傍の床に転がった“何か”は、まるで作り物のようだった。
#. JA:   切断面の生々しさが、却って安っぽい玩具のように思えた。
msgctxt "RGN0_059"
msgid ""
"The thing that tumbled on the floor looks out of place.\n"
"In fact, it looks a lot more like a cheap toy."
msgstr ""
"Те, що впало на підлогу, виглядало як бутафорія з дешевого фільму\n"
"жахів."

#. Key: RGN0_060
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 二つの映像を脳裏に焼き付け、停止しかけた脳に状況を理解させようと試みる。
msgctxt "RGN0_060"
msgid "Its image burns itself into my mind, but my head still can't figure out what it is."
msgstr ""
"Цей образ випалюється в моїй пам'яті, але мозок усе ще не може\n"
"збагнути, що це."

#. Key: RGN0_061
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ややあって、脳が状況を整理し終えたとき得た回答は
#. JA:   最も導き出したくない―――――認めたくないものであった。
#. JA: ややあって導き出された回答は、最も認め難いものであった。
msgctxt "RGN0_061"
msgid "The answer slowly dawns on me."
msgstr "Відповідь поволі доходить до мене."

#. Key: RGN0_062
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 刹那―――――右腕にあり得ないはずの感覚が奔った。
#. JA:   強烈な熱。痛みではない…。とにかく熱い。
#. JA:   堪えきれず、絶叫した。
#. JA: 刹那―――――右腕にあり得ないはずの感覚が奔った。
#. JA:   痛みなどではない。ただひたすらに強烈な熱。
#. JA:   堪えきれず、絶叫した。
msgctxt "RGN0_062"
msgid ""
"My right arm is gone.\n"
"The sensation finally registering, unimaginable pain takes its place.\n"
"But it isn't the only thing I feel—it's heat. It's hot...it's burning."
msgstr ""
"Моєї правої руки немає. Коли свідомість нарешті це приймає, мене\n"
"пронизує немислимий біль. Та я відчуваю не лише біль — це жар.\n"
"Гаряче... усе палає."

#. Key: RGN0_063
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うぁぁぁあああああああああああ！！！！！！！！
#. JA:   腕がぁああああああああああああ！！！！
#. JA: 「うぁぁぁあああああああああああ！！！！！！！！
#. JA:   　腕がぁああああああああああああ！！！！」
msgctxt "RGN0_063"
msgid ""
"<DQ>AAAAUUUUUUGGGGGHHHH!\n"
" MY ARM! AAAGGGHHH!<DQ>"
msgstr "«А-А-А-А-А-А-А-А-А-АРГХ! МОЯ РУКА! А-А-АРГХ!»"

#. Key: RGN0_064
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: やっべー、ちょー痛そうじゃん、ラグナちゃん！
#. JA:   痛い？　ねぇ痛い？　そりゃ痛いよなぁ。あははははっ！！
#. JA: 
#. JA:   「やっべー、ちょー痛そうじゃん、ラグナちゃん！
#. JA:   　痛い？　ねぇ痛い？　そりゃ痛いよなぁ。あははははっ！！」
msgctxt "RGN0_064"
msgid ""
"\n"
"<DQ>Oh man, you seem to be in quite a bit of pain there, Raggy!\n"
" Does it hurt? Does it? Of course, it does. Ahahahahah!<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"«Ого, схоже, тобі страшенно боляче, Раґі! Боляче? Ну, боляче? Авжеж\n"
"боляче. А-ха-ха-ха-ха!»"

#. Key: RGN0_065
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うあ、すげー血ィ出てるし。
#. JA:   死ぬの？　死んじゃうの？　なあ死んじゃいそう？
#. JA: 「うあ、すげー血ィ出てるし。
#. JA:   　死ぬの？　死んじゃうの？　なあ死んじゃいそう？」
msgctxt "RGN0_065"
msgid ""
"<DQ>Whoa, you're bleeding all over the place.\n"
" You gonna die? Bite the big one? Hey, think you're gonna die?<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"«Овва, з тебе кров юшить. Ти помреш? Відкинеш копита? Гей, думаєш,\n"
"скоро помреш?»"

#. Key: RGN0_066
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……ジン、サヤ連れて逃げろ……。
#. JA: 「……ジン、サヤを連れて逃げろ……」
msgctxt "RGN0_066"
msgid "<DQ>...Jin, take Saya and run...<DQ>"
msgstr "«...Джіне, забирай Саю й тікай...»"

#. Key: RGN0_067
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 熱に耐えて必死にそれだけを喉から絞り出していう。
#. JA: 熱に耐えて必死にそれだけを喉から絞り出した。
msgctxt "RGN0_067"
msgid "I shove the pain aside long enough to choke out what I think are my last words."
msgstr ""
"Я щосили пригнічую біль, щоб вичавити із себе, як мені здається,\n"
"останні слова."

#. Key: RGN0_068
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 兄さんが……兄さんが悪いんだよ……。
#. JA: 「兄さんが……兄さんが悪いんだよ……」
msgctxt "RGN0_068"
msgid "<DQ>It's... It's all your fault, Brother...<DQ>"
msgstr "«Це... Це все через тебе, братику...»"

#. Key: RGN0_069
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: な、何…いってんだ……おまえ。
#. JA: 「な、何……いってんだ……おまえ」
msgctxt "RGN0_069"
msgid "<DQ>What the hell are you...talking about...?<DQ>"
msgstr "«Що ти, в біса... верзеш...?»"

#. Key: RGN0_070
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: も～ちょっと遊んでやりたいとこだけど、
#. JA:   そろそろタイムオーバーってやつ？
#. JA: 「も～ちょっと遊んでやりたいとこだけど、
#. JA:   　そろそろタイムオーバーってやつ？」
msgctxt "RGN0_070"
msgid "<DQ>I wish I had more time to play with you, but I'm afraid I'm out of time.<DQ>"
msgstr "«Я б іще з тобою погрався, але, боюся, мій час вийшов.»"

#. Key: RGN0_071
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ちょー残念！
#. JA:   まっ、あのムカつくババアは
#. JA:   ぶっ殺したしもういいか。
#. JA: 「ちょー残念！
#. JA:   　まっ、あのムカつくババアは
#. JA:   　ブッ殺したしもういいか」
msgctxt "RGN0_071"
msgid ""
"<DQ>Damn, what a shame!\n"
" Well, I don't suppose there's any harm in killing that old hag.<DQ>"
msgstr "«От чорт, яка прикрість! А втім, стару каргу я вже вбив, тож нехай.»"

#. Key: RGN0_072
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……あ……待て、テメェ……ま……
#. JA: 「……あ……待て、テメェ……ま……」
msgctxt "RGN0_072"
msgid ""
"\n"
"<DQ>...Ah...wait...damn you... Wai...t...<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"«...А... стій... падлюко... За... чекай...»"

#. Key: RGN0_073
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あらら、すでにもう虫の息ってやつ？
#. JA:   おーい聞こえてますか～？
#. JA: 「あらら、すでにもう虫の息ってやつ？
#. JA:   　おーい聞こえてますか～？」
msgctxt "RGN0_073"
msgid ""
"\n"
"<DQ>Man, oh man...don't tell me you're gonna kick the bucket already?\n"
" Heeey, can you hear me?<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"«Ой-ой... невже вже однією ногою в могилі? Ге-е-ей, ти мене чуєш?»"

#. Key: RGN0_074
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ま、いいか、んじゃ俺、還るわ。
#. JA:   そっちのメスガキはもらってくよ～ん。
#. JA: 「ま、いいか、んじゃ俺、還るわ。
#. JA:   　そっちのメスガキはもらってくよ～ん」
msgctxt "RGN0_074"
msgid ""
"<DQ>Oh well, I gotta be on my way.\n"
" I'll need that little brat, though...<DQ>"
msgstr "«Ну й добре, мені вже час. А цю малу погань я заберу із собою...»"

#. Key: RGN0_075
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: じゃあね、兄さん……。
#. JA: 「じゃあね、兄さん……」
msgctxt "RGN0_075"
msgid ""
"\n"
"<DQ>Good-bye, Brother...<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"«Прощавай, братику...»"

#. Key: RGN0_082
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そこで、ラグナの意識は途絶えた。
msgctxt "RGN0_082"
msgid "This is where my memories of that day end."
msgstr "На цьому мої спогади про той день обриваються."

#. Key: RGN0_084
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 肌を刺すような雨にうたれ目を覚ました。
msgctxt "RGN0_084"
msgid "I wake up to a thunderous downpour of rain."
msgstr "Я приходжу до тями під оглушливою зливою."

#. Key: RGN0_085
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……生きてる……のか……。
#. JA: 「……生きてる……のか……」
msgctxt "RGN0_085"
msgid "<DQ>...Am I...alive?<DQ>"
msgstr "«...Я... живий?»"

#. Key: RGN0_086
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 身を起こそうとして、断念した。
#. JA:   体中がまるで重石をつけられたようにダルく、重い。
#. JA:   仕方なしにごろんと横に転がる。
#. JA: 身を起こそうとして、断念した。
#. JA:   身体が重い……。まるで、全身に重石をつけられているかのようだ。
#. JA:   仕方なしにごろんと横に寝転がった。
msgctxt "RGN0_086"
msgid ""
"I try to lift my body up, but it feels like I've been nailed to the ground.\n"
"So much for that."
msgstr "Я намагаюся підвестися, але здається, наче мене прибили до землі.\nДоводиться облишити спроби."

#. Key: RGN0_087
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 右肩から先には、焼け付くような痛みがあった。
#. JA:   失われた先の部分にも、痛覚が残留している。
#. JA:   再び感じるはずのない痛みにラグナは顔を歪ませた。
#. JA: 右肩から先には焼け付くような痛みがあった。
#. JA:   失われた先の部分にも、痛覚が残留している。
#. JA:   再び感じるはずのない痛みにラグナは顔を歪ませた。
msgctxt "RGN0_087"
msgid ""
"My shoulder feels like it's on fire where my arm used to be.\n"
"Something deep down tells me the pain's just an illusion."
msgstr ""
"Плече палає там, де колись була рука. Та щось глибоко всередині\n"
"підказує: цей біль — лише примара."

#. Key: RGN0_088
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: …そうか……腕は――――
#. JA: 「……そうか……腕は―――」
msgctxt "RGN0_088"
msgid "<DQ>...That's right...I lost my arm...<DQ>"
msgstr "«...Точно... Я втратив руку...»"

#. Key: RGN0_089
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 立ち上がる気力はなかった。
#. JA:   うつろな目で、焼け崩れて細い煙を立ち上らせる教会を
#. JA:   横眼で見つめる。
#. JA: 立ち上がる気力はなかった。
#. JA:   辛うじて視線だけを動かし、細い煙を立ち上らせる焼け崩れた教会を眺める。
msgctxt "RGN0_089"
msgid ""
"I still can't stand up.\n"
"All I can do is stare at the ruins of the church."
msgstr ""
"Я досі не можу встати. Мені лишається тільки дивитися на руїни\n"
"церкви."

#. Key: RGN0_092
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あれは――――
#. JA: 「あれは―――」
msgctxt "RGN0_092"
msgid "<DQ>That's...<DQ>"
msgstr "«Це ж...»"

#. Key: RGN0_093
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 妹のオルゴールが瓦礫の傍らに転がっていた。
msgctxt "RGN0_093"
msgid "Saya's music box is sitting in the middle of the rubble."
msgstr "Посеред уламків лежить музична скринька Саї."

#. Key: RGN0_094
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ちくしょう……ちくしょう……ちくしょおおおおおおっ！
#. JA: 「ちくしょう……ちくしょう……ちくしょおおおおおおっ！」
msgctxt "RGN0_094"
msgid "<DQ>Shit... Shit... SHIIIIIIIIIIIIT!<DQ>"
msgstr "«Чорт... Чорт... ЧО-О-О-О-О-ОРТ!»"

#. Key: RGN0_095
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 全てが破壊され、全てが奪われた。
#. JA:   出来ることといえば叫ぶことだけ。
#. JA: 
#. JA:   全てが破壊され、全てが奪われた。
#. JA:   できることといえば叫ぶことだけ。
msgctxt "RGN0_095"
msgid ""
"\n"
"It's gone. All of it. Everything important to me is taken by the flames.\n"
"My body is useless. All I can do is scream."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Усе зникло. Полум'я забрало все, що було мені дороге. Тіло не\n"
"слухається. Я можу лише кричати."

#. Key: RGN0_096
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: だから、ただ叫び続けた。
#. JA:   再び、気を失うその瞬間まで。
#. JA: だから、ただ叫び続けた。
#. JA:   
#. JA:   再び、気を失うその瞬間まで。
msgctxt "RGN0_096"
msgid ""
"So that's what I do...\n"
"\n"
"...until I pass out again."
msgstr "Тож я кричу...\n\n...доки знову не непритомнію."

#. Key: RGN1_001
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ハァ、ハァ、ハァ、ハァ……。
#. JA: ハァ、ハァ、ハァ、ハァ……
msgctxt "RGN1_001"
msgid "*pant* *pant* *pant* *pant*"
msgstr "*важко дихає*"

#. Key: RGN1_003
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: クソッ……またこの夢か。
#. JA:   いい加減にして欲しいぜ、まったく。
msgctxt "RGN1_003"
msgid ""
"Damn it... Not this dream again.\n"
"I wish they'd knock it off already... Hmph."
msgstr "Чорт... Знову цей сон. Коли він уже припиниться... Тьху."

#. Key: RGN1_004
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺は顔から右手を離した。
#. JA:   思い通りに動く、俺の右腕――――その忌々しさに舌打ちをする。
#. JA: 俺は顔から右手を離した。
#. JA:   思い通りに動く、俺の右腕―――その忌々しさに舌打ちをする。
msgctxt "RGN1_004"
msgid ""
"I lift my right hand off my face and look at it.\n"
"It moves just like I want it to...\n"
"...Shit."
msgstr ""
"Я забираю праву руку від обличчя й дивлюся на неї. Вона рухається саме\n"
"так, як я хочу... ...Лайно."

#. Key: RGN1_005
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: その時、覚えのある気配を感じた。
msgctxt "RGN1_005"
msgid "...Wait. What the hell is she doing here?"
msgstr "...Стривай. Якого біса вона тут робить?"

#. Key: RGN1_006
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 酷い顔ね、ラグナ。
#. JA:   まるで悪夢でも見たような――――。
#. JA: 酷い顔ね、ラグナ。
#. JA:   まるで悪夢でも見たような―――。
msgctxt "RGN1_006"
msgid ""
"You look pale, Ragna.\n"
"A nightmare, perhaps?"
msgstr "Ти зблід, Раґно. Наснився кошмар?"

#. Key: RGN1_007
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 声のした方向を振り向く。
#. JA:   朝日を背景にして、ふざけた形の傘を持つ子供が立っていた。
#. JA:   その髪を結ぶ二つのリボンがぴんと立っている様はまるで――――
#. JA: 声のした方向を振り向く。
#. JA:   朝日を背景にして、ふざけた形の傘を持つ子供が立っていた。
#. JA:   その髪を結ぶ二つのリボンがぴんと立っている様はまるで―――
msgctxt "RGN1_007"
msgid ""
"I turn toward the voice.\n"
"Before me stands a young girl holding a strange umbrella.\n"
"There are two ribbons holding her hair in place. They make her look like a—"
msgstr ""
"Я повертаюся на голос. Переді мною стоїть юна дівчина з дивною\n"
"парасолькою. Дві стрічки у волоссі роблять її схожою на—"

#. Key: RGN1_008
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……なんだよ、ウサギ。
#. JA: ……なんだよ、ウサギ
msgctxt "RGN1_008"
msgid "...What do you want, rabbit?"
msgstr "...Чого тобі, кролице?"

#. Key: RGN1_009
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うなされていてすごく見苦しかったから、
#. JA:   わざわざこの私が起こしてあげたのよ、感謝しなさい。
msgctxt "RGN1_009"
msgid "You were groaning in your sleep, so I took pity and woke you, ungrateful beast."
msgstr ""
"Ти стогнав уві сні, тож я змилостивилася й розбудила тебе, невдячний\n"
"звір."

#. Key: RGN1_010
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 姫様があんたみたいな珍獣にかまってあげてるのよ、
#. JA:   感謝しなさい。
#. JA: 姫様があんたみたいな珍獣にかまってあげてるのよ。
#. JA:   感謝しなさい。
msgctxt "RGN1_010"
msgid ""
"Yeah. You should be thankful the princess is even wasting her time...on a man like\n"
"you."
msgstr ""
"Ага. Ти мав би дякувати, що принцеса взагалі витрачає час... на такого,\n"
"як ти."

#. Key: RGN1_011
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 感謝するっス！
msgctxt "RGN1_011"
msgid "You're in her debt!"
msgstr "Ти перед нею в боргу!"

#. Key: RGN1_012
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ゴン！×２
msgctxt "RGN1_012"
msgid ""
"Bonk!\n"
"Clunk!"
msgstr "Бух! Геп!"

#. Key: RGN1_013
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nago and Gii
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 姫さま痛い！
msgctxt "RGN1_013"
msgid ""
"Ow, that hurt...!\n"
"That hurt, Princess!"
msgstr "Ай, боляче...! Боляче, принцесо!"

#. Key: RGN1_014
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 姫さま痛いっス！
msgctxt "RGN1_014"
msgid "That hurt, Princess!"
msgstr "Боляче, принцесо!"

#. Key: RGN1_015
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 調子に乗ったウサギの取り巻き共が主に小突かれる。
#. JA:   ペットだか下僕だか知ったことじゃないが、毎度ウサギの
#. JA:   威を借りてぴーちくぱーちくうるさい。
#. JA: 調子に乗ったウサギの取り巻き共が主に小突かれていた。
#. JA:   ペットだか下僕だか知ったことじゃないが、毎度ウサギの威を借りて
#. JA:   ぴーちくぱーちくうるさい。
msgctxt "RGN1_015"
msgid ""
"I don't know if those two things are her friends or her servants, but what I do know is\n"
"that they're gonna piss me off if they don't get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"Не знаю, друзі їй ці двоє чи слуги, але знаю одне: якщо вони негайно не\n"
"заберуться, я не витримаю."

#. Key: RGN1_016
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: でも珍獣っていうのは良い喩えね……。
#. JA:   こうして人目につかない場所で寝ていることといい、
#. JA:   観ていて飽きないところといい、ぴったりだわ。
msgctxt "RGN1_016"
msgid ""
"A rare beast...how strangely appropriate. You sleep where others fear to tread, and\n"
"you are always very, very entertaining. How perfect."
msgstr ""
"Рідкісний звір... Як влучно. Ти спиш там, куди інші бояться ступити, і\n"
"завжди чудово мене розважаєш. Просто ідеально."

#. Key: RGN1_017
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うっせぇな！　テメェの方が十分珍獣だろ！
#. JA:   この吸血鬼！！
#. JA: うっせぇな！
#. JA:   テメェの方が十分珍獣だろ！　この吸血鬼！！
msgctxt "RGN1_017"
msgid ""
"Shut the hell up! You're more like a rare beast than I'll ever be!\n"
"Vampire!"
msgstr "Заткнися! Та це ти більше схожа на рідкісну тварюку! Вампірко!"

#. Key: RGN1_018
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ドゴン！
#. JA: ドゴ～ン！
msgctxt "RGN1_018"
msgid "Ka-boom!"
msgstr "Ба-бах!"

#. Key: RGN1_019
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うおっ、あぶねっ！
msgctxt "RGN1_019"
msgid "Argh, what the—"
msgstr "Аргх, якого—"

#. Key: RGN1_020
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 生意気な珍獣ね。
#. JA:   そういえば、貴方すごい賞金が懸けられているみたいじゃない……。
#. JA:   今ならいくらくらいで引き取ってくれるのかしら？
#. JA: 生意気な珍獣ね。
#. JA:   そういえば、貴方すごい賞金が懸けられているみたいじゃない……。
#. JA:   今なら幾ら位で引き取ってくれるのかしら？
msgctxt "RGN1_020"
msgid ""
"What a cocky little creature you are...\n"
"Which reminds me... You have a rather handsome bounty on your head, don't you?\n"
"I wonder how much you're worth right now?"
msgstr ""
"Яке ж ти зухвале створіння... До речі... За твою голову ж призначено\n"
"чималу нагороду, так? Цікаво, скільки ти зараз коштуєш?"

#. Key: RGN1_021
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おい、笑えねぇぞウサギ……。
msgctxt "RGN1_021"
msgid "Hey, that isn't funny, rabbit..."
msgstr "Гей, це не смішно, кролице..."

#. Key: RGN1_022
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 姫様、珍獣が吠えてるわよ～。
msgctxt "RGN1_022"
msgid "Your Highness, this dog's barking something..."
msgstr "Ваша Високосте, цей пес щось там гавкає..."

#. Key: RGN1_023
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 弱い犬ほどよく吠えるって言うッス。
msgctxt "RGN1_023"
msgid "The weaker they are, the louder they bark."
msgstr "Що слабші, то голосніше гавкають."

#. Key: RGN1_024
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うっせーぞ、このマスコットども！！
msgctxt "RGN1_024"
msgid "Shut up. You're nothing but stuffed toys!"
msgstr "Заткніться. Ви просто іграшки!"

#. Key: RGN1_025
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: この子たちの言葉を真に受けるなんて、貴方も器が小さいわね。
msgctxt "RGN1_025"
msgid "If these simpletons can rouse you to anger, you still have much to learn."
msgstr ""
"Якщо ці недоумки здатні тебе розлютити, тобі ще багато чого слід\n"
"навчитися."

#. Key: RGN1_026
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あーもう、ほんっきでムカついた！
#. JA:   レイチェル！　テメェ、マジ泣かすぞ！
msgctxt "RGN1_026"
msgid "Argh, that does it! Now I'm really pissed! I'm gonna make you regret this, Rachel!"
msgstr "Аргх, досить! Тепер я справді злий! Ти про це пошкодуєш, Рейчел!"

#. Key: RGN1_027
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 出来るものならどうぞ。
#. JA: できるものならどうぞ。
msgctxt "RGN1_027"
msgid "Oh, please do try. I would like that very much."
msgstr "Будь ласка, спробуй. Мені цього дуже хочеться."

#. Key: RGN1_031
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どうしたのラグナ、泣かせてくれるのではなくて？
msgctxt "RGN1_031"
msgid ""
"What's the matter Ragna?\n"
"I thought you were going to make me regret something..."
msgstr "Що таке, Раґно? Ти начебто хотів змусити мене про щось пошкодувати..."

#. Key: RGN1_032
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: レイチェル様。
msgctxt "RGN1_032"
msgid "Madam Rachel."
msgstr "Пані Рейчел."

#. Key: RGN1_033
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あら、ヴァルケンハイン 、貴方も珍獣鑑賞に？
#. JA: あら、ヴァルケンハイン。貴方も珍獣鑑賞に？
msgctxt "RGN1_033"
msgid "Oh, Valkenhayn. Are you here to collect the bounty on this creature?"
msgstr "О, Валькенгайне. Прийшов забрати нагороду за цю істоту?"

#. Key: RGN1_034
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: いえ、朝食の時間となりましたのでお迎えにあがりました。
msgctxt "RGN1_034"
msgid ""
"Of course not, madam. I only wish to humbly inform you that breakfast awaits Your\n"
"Ladyship in the dining hall."
msgstr ""
"Звісно, ні, пані. Я лише хотів покірно повідомити, що в їдальні на Вашу\n"
"Світлість чекає сніданок."

#. Key: RGN1_035
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そう。ナゴ、ギィ、帰るわよ。
#. JA:   ほら、馬鹿を構うのはお止めなさい。変な病気が伝染るわ。
#. JA: そう。ナゴ、ギィ、帰るわよ。
#. JA:   ほら、馬鹿を構うのはお止めなさい。変な病気が伝<ruby>う</ruby>染<ruby>つ</ruby>るわ。
msgctxt "RGN1_035"
msgid ""
"Very well. Nago, Gii, it is high time we left.\n"
"And do stop playing with that idiot. I worry his stupidity is contagious."
msgstr ""
"Гаразд. Наґо, Ґі, нам час іти. І припиніть гратися з цим ідіотом. Боюся,\n"
"його дурість заразна."

#. Key: RGN1_036
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ちきしょう……。
#. JA: ちきしょう……
msgctxt "RGN1_036"
msgid "Damn you all..."
msgstr "Щоб ви всі провалилися..."

#. Key: RGN1_037
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……あてが外れたわ。
msgctxt "RGN1_037"
msgid "...That was rather a disappointment."
msgstr "...Як розчаровує."

#. Key: RGN1_041
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おいっウサギ！
#. JA:   ……人をからかうのもいい加減にしろよ。
msgctxt "RGN1_041"
msgid ""
"Hey, rabbit!\n"
"...You better hope I never see you buttin' into human affairs again."
msgstr "Гей, кролице! ...Краще більше не лізь у людські справи."

#. Key: RGN1_042
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あら怖い。
#. JA: あら怖い
msgctxt "RGN1_042"
msgid "Words cannot describe my fear."
msgstr "Не можу описати, як мені страшно."

#. Key: RGN1_043
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ムキになっちゃって、ほんとガキンチョね。
msgctxt "RGN1_043"
msgid "Losing your temper like a little kid... You need to grow up, boy."
msgstr "Зриваєшся, наче мале дитя... Тобі час подорослішати, хлопче."

#. Key: RGN1_044
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ガキンチョっス。
msgctxt "RGN1_044"
msgid "A brat, indeed."
msgstr "Справжнє дитя."

#. Key: RGN1_045
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 負けておいて偉そうなこと言ってんじゃねえ！！
msgctxt "RGN1_045"
msgid "You guys lost, so why are you even talkin'!?"
msgstr "Ви програли, то чого досі патякаєте!?"

#. Key: RGN1_046
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: レイチェル様。
msgctxt "RGN1_046"
msgid "Madam Rachel."
msgstr "Пані Рейчел."

#. Key: RGN1_047
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あら、ヴァルケンハイン 、貴方も珍獣鑑賞に？
#. JA: あら、ヴァルケンハイン 。貴方も珍獣鑑賞に？
msgctxt "RGN1_047"
msgid "Oh, Valkenhayn. Are you here to collect the bounty on this creature?"
msgstr "О, Валькенгайне. Прийшов забрати нагороду за цю істоту?"

#. Key: RGN1_048
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 突如、空間にスッと線が現れたかと思うと、
#. JA:   中から燕尾服を着たオッサンが現れた。
#. JA:   俺には目もくれず、ウサギと話している。
msgctxt "RGN1_048"
msgid ""
"What the hell!? It looked like someone sliced open the air, and some old fart in a tux\n"
"just appeared out of nowhere... Doesn't seem interested in me though, just that\n"
"damn rabbit..."
msgstr ""
"Якого біса!? Наче хтось розрізав повітря, і з нізвідки з'явився старий у\n"
"смокінгу... Та він, схоже, дивиться не на мене, а на ту кляту кролицю..."

#. Key: RGN1_049
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: いえ、朝食のお時間となりましたのでお迎えにあがりました。
msgctxt "RGN1_049"
msgid ""
"Of course not, madam. I only wish to humbly inform you that breakfast awaits Your\n"
"Ladyship in the dining hall."
msgstr ""
"Звісно, ні, пані. Я лише хотів покірно повідомити, що в їдальні на Вашу\n"
"Світлість чекає сніданок."

#. Key: RGN1_050
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……そう。もうそんな時間なのね。
msgctxt "RGN1_050"
msgid "Goodness, breakfast time already?"
msgstr "Овва, уже час снідати?"

#. Key: RGN1_051
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: それとあまりお戯れをされては困ります。
#. JA:   このような下賎の輩に関わられては、先代に申し訳立ちません。
#. JA: それとあまりお戯れをされては困ります。
#. JA:   このような下賎の輩に関わられては、先代に申し訳が立ちません。
msgctxt "RGN1_051"
msgid ""
"I would also humbly suggest that you avoid men of the lower classes, such as that\n"
"filthy creature there... Madam must consider her station."
msgstr ""
"Також насмілюся порадити вам уникати чоловіків нижчого стану, як-от\n"
"та брудна істота... Пані слід пам'ятати про своє становище."

#. Key: RGN1_052
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: んだとテメェ！
msgctxt "RGN1_052"
msgid "—the hell'd you say!?"
msgstr "—що ти сказав!?"

#. Key: RGN1_053
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……あまり調子にのるな、小僧。
msgctxt "RGN1_053"
msgid "...Go home, kid. The hour is late."
msgstr "...Іди додому, хлопче. Вже пізно."

#. Key: RGN1_054
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ウサギに対する穏やかな姿勢からは想像もつかないくらい、
#. JA:   威圧感たっぷりに執事が俺をにらみつけてくる。
msgctxt "RGN1_054"
msgid ""
"He sure doesn't seem scared of the rabbit, but that glare he threw my way wasn't\n"
"real friendly..."
msgstr "Кролиці він явно не боїться, але й погляд, яким він мене зміряв,\nдружнім не назвеш..."

#. Key: RGN1_055
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そうよ！
msgctxt "RGN1_055"
msgid "That's right!"
msgstr "Саме так!"

#. Key: RGN1_056
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そうッス！
msgctxt "RGN1_056"
msgid "I'd take his advice if I were you..."
msgstr "На твоєму місці я б його послухалася..."

#. Key: RGN1_057
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ゴン！×２
msgctxt "RGN1_057"
msgid ""
"Smack!\n"
"Thwack!"
msgstr "Ляп! Хряп!"

#. Key: RGN1_058
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nago and Gii
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 姫さま痛い！
msgctxt "RGN1_058"
msgid ""
"Princess, what was that for!?\n"
"Princess, that hurt!"
msgstr "Принцесо, за що!? Принцесо, боляче!"

#. Key: RGN1_059
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 姫さま痛いっス！
msgctxt "RGN1_059"
msgid "Princess, that hurt!"
msgstr "Принцесо, боляче!"

#. Key: RGN1_060
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ヴァルケンハイン 、今日の朝食は？
msgctxt "RGN1_060"
msgid "Valkenhayn, what have you prepared for my breakfast?"
msgstr "Валькенгайне, що ти приготував мені на сніданок?"

#. Key: RGN1_061
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 良い魚が手に入りましたので、ポワレに致しました。
#. JA:   スープは空豆のポタージュでございます。
#. JA:   それとお飲物は―――――
#. JA: 良い魚が手に入りましたので、ポワレに致しました。
#. JA:   スープは空豆のポタージュでございます。それとお飲物は―――――
msgctxt "RGN1_061"
msgid ""
"I was able to secure a delectable piscine specimen today, which I have taken the\n"
"liberty of crafting into a poêlé dish. I have also prepared you a vibrant potage,\n"
"which will be accompanied by your drink, a— "
msgstr ""
"Сьогодні мені вдалося дістати вишукану рибу, я підсмажив її філе.\n"
"Також на вас чекає яскравий потаж і напій —"

#. Key: RGN1_062
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: トマトジュースは嫌よ。
msgctxt "RGN1_062"
msgid "I despise tomato juice."
msgstr "Я ненавиджу томатний сік."

#. Key: RGN1_063
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……存じております。
msgctxt "RGN1_063"
msgid "...I am well aware of that, madam."
msgstr "...Я чудово це знаю, пані."

#. Key: RGN1_064
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なら、いいわ。…ナゴ、ギィ、帰るわよ。
#. JA: なら、いいわ。……ナゴ、ギィ、帰るわよ。
msgctxt "RGN1_064"
msgid "Well, good. Nago, Gii, it's high time we left."
msgstr "Добре. Наґо, Ґі, нам час іти."

#. Key: RGN1_065
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: とっとと帰りやがれ、そしてもう二度とくんじゃねー！！！
msgctxt "RGN1_065"
msgid "It's about damn time. Go home, and never come back!"
msgstr "Нарешті. Ідіть додому й більше не повертайтеся!"

#. Key: RGN1_066
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 少しだけ楽しめたわ、また会いましょう、死神さん。
msgctxt "RGN1_066"
msgid ""
"Oh, but I did enjoy myself a small bit.\n"
"Shall we meet again some time, Mr. Grim Reaper?"
msgstr ""
"Та я все ж трохи розважилася. Може, ще якось зустрінемося, пане\n"
"Женць?"

#. Key: RGN1_068
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 小僧、少しは頭が冷えたろう。
#. JA:   あまりレイチェル様の手を煩わせるな。
msgctxt "RGN1_068"
msgid ""
"I think you have done quite enough, child. Your births have already placed you\n"
"worlds apart—I would advise you to maintain the distance."
msgstr ""
"Гадаю, ти вже зробив достатньо, дитя. Саме ваше походження розділило\n"
"вас цілими світами — раджу й надалі тримати цю відстань."

#. Key: RGN1_069
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 言いたい放題いって、ウサギ（ついでに取り巻き）とオッサンはどっかの異空間に姿を消えていった。俺にはどうすることも出来ず、それを見送ることしかできない。
#. JA: 言いたい放題いって、ウサギとオッサン（ついでに取り巻き）はどっかの異空間に姿を消していった。
#. JA:   俺にはそれを、ただ見送ることしかできない。
msgctxt "RGN1_069"
msgid ""
"So they just come here to give me crap and then book it? Screw that! Where the hell\n"
"did they go anyway? I don't think I coulda followed 'em if I wanted to..."
msgstr ""
"То вони прийшли, облили мене лайном і втекли? От паскуди! Куди вони\n"
"взагалі поділися? Я б за ними не встиг, навіть якби захотів..."

#. Key: RGN1_070
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 何言ってやがるあの野郎、くそっ、マジでムカつく！
#. JA:   すげぇ余計な体力つかっちまったじゃねーか……。
msgctxt "RGN1_070"
msgid "The hell is that guy talking about? Argh, seriously! What a huge waste of time..."
msgstr ""
"І про що той дід узагалі говорив? Аргх, серйозно! Стільки часу\n"
"змарновано..."

#. Key: RGN1_071
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺の文句は、闇に吸い込まれて消えるだけだった。
#. JA: 俺の文句は、風に吹き散らされて消えるだけだった。
msgctxt "RGN1_071"
msgid "Nobody here to listen to my bitchin'... Just gets swallowed up by the darkness."
msgstr "Навіть вислухати моє ниття нікому... Усе просто розчиняється в темряві."

#. Key: RGN1_072
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……ちっ。胸くそ悪ィ…。
#. JA: ……ちっ。胸くそ悪ィ……。
msgctxt "RGN1_072"
msgid "Tch... I don't like this one bit..."
msgstr "Тьху... Мені це зовсім не подобається..."

#. Key: RGN1_073
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: だが、今の戦いで頭が冷えて気分も落ち着いてきたのも事実だった。
msgctxt "RGN1_073"
msgid "Still, I guess that fight did give me a chance to blow off a little steam..."
msgstr "А втім, завдяки цій бійці я хоча б трохи випустив пару..."

#. Key: RGN1_074
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……クソが！
msgctxt "RGN1_074"
msgid "...Goddammit!"
msgstr "...От лайно!"

#. Key: RGN1_075
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そんな事を考えいたら霧が晴れてきてその向こうに今回の目的地が視界に入った。
#. JA: イライラする気持ちを抑えつつ、歩みを進める。
#. JA:   間もなく霧が晴れると、その向こうに今回の目的地が視界に入ってきた。
msgctxt "RGN1_075"
msgid ""
"...Whatever. Being pissed ain't gonna help me right now. Just gotta keep moving.\n"
"As the fog lifts, I can see my destination in the distance."
msgstr ""
"...Байдуже. Злість мені зараз не допоможе. Треба рухатися далі. Туман\n"
"розсіюється, і вдалині з'являється моя ціль."

#. Key: RGN1_077
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あれが第十三階層都市「カグツチ」か……。
msgctxt "RGN1_077"
msgid "So that's the 13th Hierarchical City...Kagutsuchi, huh?"
msgstr "То це Тринадцяте ієрархічне місто... Каґуцучі, га?"

#. Key: RGN2_001
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 今回は出来る限り戦闘を避けようと、列車から飛び降り最下層から、
#. JA:   階層都市カグツチへと入る。
#. JA:   ここを訪れるのは初めてだが、階層都市はどこも似たような造りであるため、あまり迷うことはなかった。
#. JA: ここを訪れるのは初めてだが、階層都市はどこも似たような造りであるため、大して迷うことはなかった。
msgctxt "RGN2_001"
msgid ""
"I've never been to this one before, but the Hierarchical Cities are all built pretty\n"
"much the same. I don't think I'll have much trouble findin' my way around."
msgstr ""
"Я тут уперше, але всі ієрархічні міста побудовані приблизно однаково. Не\n"
"думаю, що заблукаю."

#. Key: RGN2_002
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ま、取りあえず上に向かって歩いてけば着くし……ん？
msgctxt "RGN2_002"
msgid ""
"Well, I guess up's the only way I can go...\n"
"Hm?"
msgstr "Що ж, схоже, шлях лише один — нагору... Гм?"

#. Key: RGN2_003
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……何だ？
msgctxt "RGN2_003"
msgid "...What's that?"
msgstr "...Що це?"

#. Key: RGN2_004
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 最下層は下水道となっている。
#. JA:   上を目指して階段を探していると、ぼろを纏った黒い影が目に映った。
#. JA:   一瞬、幽霊かと思って本気でビビった俺がいた……。
#. JA: 通例、最下層は下水道となっている。
#. JA:   上を目指して階段を探していると、ぼろを纏った黒い影が目に映った。
#. JA:   一瞬幽霊かとちょっぴり、いやほんの少しビビった俺がいた……。
msgctxt "RGN2_004"
msgid ""
"Usually the only thing you find on the bottom levels is crap, literally, but I think I\n"
"just saw a black shadow move across the stairs...\n"
"...Shit, there it is again..."
msgstr ""
"Зазвичай на нижніх рівнях можна знайти лише лайно — буквально. Але\n"
"щойно на сходах промайнула якась чорна тінь... ...Дідько, он вона знову..."

#. Key: RGN2_005
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 幽霊は反則だ。
#. JA:   ぶっ叩いてもぶった切っても無駄だ。
#. JA:   そんなモンに、俺は関わりたくない――――
#. JA: 幽霊は反則だ。
#. JA:   ぶっ叩いてもぶった切っても無駄だ。
#. JA:   そんなモンに、俺は関わりたくない―――
msgctxt "RGN2_005"
msgid ""
"That thing better not be a goddamn ghost... Ghosts are just playing dirty. Can't hit\n"
"'em, cut 'em, anything... I really don't have time for a freakin' ghost right now..."
msgstr ""
"Тільки б це не був довбаний привид... З привидами все нечесно: їх не\n"
"вдариш, не розрубаєш — нічого. У мене зараз геть немає часу на клятих\n"
"привидів..."

#. Key: RGN2_006
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: しかしどうも奴は幽霊とは違うようだ。
#. JA:   覚えのある「力」を感じた。これは……。
#. JA: しかしどうも奴は幽霊とは違うようだ。
#. JA:   覚えのある“力”を感じた。これは……。
msgctxt "RGN2_006"
msgid "...Doesn't feel like a ghost...but something about it does feel familiar..."
msgstr "...На привида не схоже... але в ньому є щось знайоме..."

#. Key: RGN2_007
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 薄気味悪い動きしやがって、まったく。
#. JA:   テメェ……境界から力を取り入れてるな。
msgctxt "RGN2_007"
msgid ""
"Argh. What the hell is wrong with you?\n"
"You're harnessing power from the Boundary, aren't you?"
msgstr "Аргх. Що з тобою не так? Ти черпаєш силу з Межі, так?"

#. Key: RGN2_008
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 貴様か　蒼　蒼　色　じる
msgctxt "RGN2_008"
msgid "I     sense...    pow   o      Azure fro   ou..."
msgstr "Я від уваю... в то і си у Лазурі..."

#. Key: RGN2_009
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……なれの果てってやつか。
msgctxt "RGN2_009"
msgid "...You've completely lost it..."
msgstr "...Ти геть здурів..."

#. Key: RGN2_010
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 蒼！　蒼！　蒼！
#. JA:   し！　狂わ　欲　る！！　ケヒャヒャヒャヒャ！
#. JA: 蒼！　蒼！　蒼！
#. JA:   　し　！！　狂わ　　　　欲　る！！　ケヒャヒャヒャヒャ！
msgctxt "RGN2_010"
msgid ""
"Azure!  zure! Az re!\n"
"  want it!   must have  t! Gehyahyahyah!"
msgstr "Лазур! Л зур! Ла ур! Я хочу її! Вона      бути моєю! Ґех'я-х'я-х'я!"

#. Key: RGN2_011
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 馬鹿だなテメェは……。
#. JA:   あんなもんに手ェ出しやがって。
msgctxt "RGN2_011"
msgid "Idiot... To turn to power like that..."
msgstr "Ідіот... Довести себе до такого заради сили..."

#. Key: RGN2_012
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そ　奪　　！　必　　！
#. JA: そ　　　　奪　！　必　！
msgctxt "RGN2_012"
msgid "Tha  power!   mu   possess   ! Now!"
msgstr "Ця си а! Я му у   заволод ти! Нега но!"

#. Key: RGN2_013
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
