#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ま、こうなるわな。
#. JA:   そのナリには同情するが……。
#. JA: ま、こうなるわな。
#. JA:   そのナリには同情するが……
msgctxt "RGN2_013"
msgid ""
"Well, that is inevitable.\n"
"Though I can sympathize with your appearance..."
msgstr "Що ж, це було неминуче. Хоча твоєму вигляду я можу поспівчувати..."

#. Key: RGN2_014
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
