#. JA: ぅ　ぅぅう　　ぅぅ
#. JA:   蒼　蒼　……欲
msgctxt "RGN2_018"
msgid ""
"Ugh...augh...oogh\n"
"Az   ...!  zure...! I nee  It..."
msgstr "Кх... ах... у-у Ла ур...! Лаз р...!    ме і потрі на..."

#. Key: RGN2_019
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ワリィな。
#. JA:   せめて苦しまずに逝かせてやるよ。
msgctxt "RGN2_019"
msgid ""
"Sorry, you can't have this.\n"
"But the least I can do is let you go in peace."
msgstr ""
"Пробач, але я тобі її не віддам. Принаймні можу подарувати тобі\n"
"спокійну смерть."

#. Key: RGN2_020
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 止めて！！
msgctxt "RGN2_020"
msgid "Stop!"
msgstr "Стійте!"

#. Key: RGN2_021
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 突如、ものすごいスピードで女が走ってきた。
#. JA:   俺と化け物の間に割って入ってくる。
#. JA:   そして、女は化け物をかばうようにして寄り添った。
#. JA: 突如、俺から化け物をかばうようにして女が割り入って来た。
msgctxt "RGN2_021"
msgid ""
"Some chick runs in out of nowhere and throws herself between me and the monster...\n"
"She trying to protect that ugly piece of crap?"
msgstr "Нізвідки вибігає якась дівчина й кидається між мною та чудовиськом...\nА потім притулилася до нього намагаючись захистити."

#. Key: RGN2_022
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あぁ？
#. JA:   何だテメェ、邪魔だどけ！
msgctxt "RGN2_022"
msgid ""
"Huh? Who the hell are you?\n"
"You're in the way. Move!"
msgstr "Га? Ти хто така? Не заважай. Відійди!"

#. Key: RGN2_023
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: この人のことは私が何とかするわ。
#. JA:   だからお願い！　今は殺さないで……。
msgctxt "RGN2_023"
msgid "I'll take care of this, so please... Don't hurt him!"
msgstr "Я сама з ним упораюся, тож прошу... Не кривдьте його!"

#. Key: RGN2_024
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……この感覚……テメェもかよ。
#. JA:   いったいこの街はどうなってやがる。
msgctxt "RGN2_024"
msgid ""
"...This feeling... You have it too, don't you?\n"
"What the hell is up with this town?"
msgstr "...Це відчуття... У тебе воно теж є, так? Що, в біса, не так із цим містом?"

#. Key: RGN2_025
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: お願い……。
msgctxt "RGN2_025"
msgid "Please..."
msgstr "Прошу..."

#. Key: RGN2_026
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
