#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: はぁ～。
msgctxt "RGN2_026"
msgid "*sigh*"
msgstr "*зітхає*"

#. Key: RGN2_027
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あんたさ、そいつが何だか解ってる？
#. JA:   そうなっちまった奴はもう元には戻れないぜ。
#. JA:   そんなことはあんたも十分承知してると思うんだが。
msgctxt "RGN2_027"
msgid ""
"Do you have any idea what that guy's done?\n"
"If you do, then you should know that it's already too late to save him."
msgstr ""
"Ти хоч уявляєш, що він накоїв? Якщо так, то маєш розуміти: рятувати\n"
"його вже запізно."

#. Key: RGN2_028
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 解ってるわ。
#. JA:   でも……何か、何か方法がある筈よ……。
msgctxt "RGN2_028"
msgid ""
"I know... I know that...\n"
"But, there has to be a way...!"
msgstr "Знаю... Я це знаю... Але мусить бути якийсь спосіб...!"

#. Key: RGN2_029
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ったくよ、どいつもこいつも境界に手ェ出しやがって……。
msgctxt "RGN2_029"
msgid "Geez, how many of you got involved with the Boundary?"
msgstr "Тьху, скільки ж вас зв'язалося з Межею?"

#. Key: RGN2_030
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ちっ、付き合いきれねーぜ。
msgctxt "RGN2_030"
msgid "Tch, I don't have time for this."
msgstr "Тьху, у мене немає на це часу."

#. Key: RGN2_031
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そうなっちまった奴は、ぶった切るしかねーんだよ。
msgctxt "RGN2_031"
msgid "It's too late to save him; I'll have to rip him a new one."
msgstr "Рятувати його запізно, тож я просто начищу йому пику."

#. Key: RGN2_036
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
