#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 蒼　……蒼　滾　……力　、グフ、グフ……グプププ
msgctxt "RGN2_036"
msgid ""
"Az   ...    Azu  ...!   fin     ha       power!\n"
"...Geheh...pffahahaha!"
msgstr "Ла ур... Лаз р...! Наре ті її    моя! ...Ґехе... пф-ха-ха-ха!"

#. Key: RGN2_037
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ヤベェ……クソ、力が……。
msgctxt "RGN2_037"
msgid "Not good... Damn, my power..."
msgstr "Погано... Чорт, моя сила..."

#. Key: RGN2_038
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 黒い粘液が俺の体を侵食していく。
#. JA:   逃げようともがけばもがくほど、どろりとした液体が執拗に絡みついた。
#. JA: 黒い粘液が俺の体を侵食していく。
#. JA:   逃げようともがけばもがくほど、
#. JA:   ドロリとした液体が執拗に絡みついてくる。
msgctxt "RGN2_038"
msgid ""
"That black shit starts to ooze over me, and the more I fight it, the deeper it pulls\n"
"me..."
msgstr ""
"Ця чорна гидота починає мене обволікати, і що більше я пручаюся, то\n"
"глибше вона мене затягує..."

#. Key: RGN2_039
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
