#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 女が俺の手をつかむ。
#. JA:   「やめろ」――――言い終わる前に粘液が俺の顔を覆った。
#. JA:   視界が暗くなる。
#. JA: 女は何を思ったか俺の手を掴んだ。―――こいつ、俺を助ける気か？
#. JA:   “やめろ！”―――言い終わる前に粘液が俺の顔を覆った。
#. JA:   視界が暗くなる。
msgctxt "RGN2_042"
msgid ""
"The chick runs over to grab my hand.\n"
"I try to yell at her to get the hell out of there, but before I can the black gunk covers\n"
"my face, and I can't see or talk."
msgstr ""
"Дівчина підбігає й хапає мене за руку. Я хочу крикнути, щоб вона\n"
"забиралася геть, але чорна гидота накриває моє обличчя раніше, ніж я\n"
"встигаю. Я більше не бачу й не можу говорити."

#. Key: RGN2_043
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: キ――――――――――――――――ヒヒヒ
#. JA:   蒼！蒼！蒼！蒼！！！
#. JA: キ――――――――――――――ヒヒヒ
#. JA:   蒼！蒼！蒼！蒼！！！
msgctxt "RGN2_043"
msgid ""
"Keeeeeeeeeeeeheeheeheehee!\n"
"Azure. Azure! Azure! Azure!"
msgstr "Кі-і-і-і-і-і-і-хі-хі-хі-хі! Лазур. Лазур! Лазур! Лазур!"

#. Key: RGN2_044
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: キャー！
msgctxt "RGN2_044"
msgid "Aaiiiieee!"
msgstr "А-а-а-а-ай!"

#. Key: RGN2_045
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ★ぬちゃぬちゃと何かに飲み込まれる音
#. JA: 化け物が、触手のようなものを伸ばし女に絡みつく。
#. JA:   女は為すすべもなく化け物の体内に引きずり込まれていく。
msgctxt "RGN2_045"
msgid ""
"The monster reached out for the chick with what appeared to be arms...\n"
"The girl couldn't do anything but be consumed by this monster."
msgstr ""
"Чудовисько простягає до дівчини щось, схоже на руки... Вона нічого не\n"
"може вдіяти, поки воно її поглинає."

#. Key: RGN2_046
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 止……めて、お願い……止め――――
#. JA: 止……めて、お願い……止めて―――
msgctxt "RGN2_046"
msgid "Stop...please...stop..."
msgstr "Припини... прошу... припини..."

#. Key: RGN2_048
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: だめだ……力が……はいらねぇ……。
#. JA: （だめだ……力が……はいらねぇ……）
msgctxt "RGN2_048"
msgid "Dammit...I can't feel...any...power..."
msgstr "Чорт... я більше... не відчуваю... сили..."

#. Key: RGN2_052
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ちっ、あーあ白けちまったぜ。
#. JA:   正直俺にとっちゃそんな奴ァどーでもいいし。
#. JA:   いいぜ、好きにしな。
msgctxt "RGN2_052"
msgid ""
"Tch, you just spoiled the mood.\n"
"To be honest, I really don't care what happens to that guy.\n"
"All right, suit yourself."
msgstr ""
"Тьху, увесь настрій зіпсувала. Якщо чесно, мені байдуже, що з ним\n"
"станеться. Гаразд, роби що хочеш."

#. Key: RGN2_053
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 180度踵を返して歩き出す。
#. JA:   厄介ごとに関わるのはごめんだった。
msgctxt "RGN2_053"
msgid ""
"I turn around and leave.\n"
"I got better things to do than waste my time with the two of them."
msgstr ""
"Я розвертаюся й іду геть. У мене є важливіші справи, ніж марнувати на\n"
"них час."

#. Key: RGN2_057
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あークソッ、やっぱ駄目だ！！
#. JA:   そいつをほっとくわけにゃ行かねえ。
#. JA:   おい、そこどけ！　でなきゃ一緒にぶった切るぞ。
msgctxt "RGN2_057"
msgid ""
"Argh, dammit! Are you blind!? There's no way we can leave that roaming around!\n"
"Move! Or I'll cut you down with him!"
msgstr ""
"Аргх, чорт! Ти що, сліпа!? Не можна дозволити цій штуці вільно\n"
"розгулювати! Відійди! Інакше я зарубаю тебе разом із ним!"

#. Key: RGN2_058
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どかないわ……。
msgctxt "RGN2_058"
msgid "I'm not moving..."
msgstr "Я не відійду..."

#. Key: RGN2_059
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あんた本当にそいつが
#. JA:   どんだけ危険なシロモンか解ってんのか？
#. JA: あんた。本当にそいつが
#. JA:   どんだけ危険なシロモンか解ってんのか？
msgctxt "RGN2_059"
msgid "Do you really know how dangerous that thing is...?"
msgstr "Ти справді розумієш, наскільки небезпечна ця істота...?"

#. Key: RGN2_060
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: もうあんたに手に負えるレベルじゃねーつぅの。
#. JA:   マジでどかなきゃあんたも逝くはめになるぞ。
#. JA: もうあんたに手に負えるレベルじゃねーっつぅの。
#. JA:   マジでどかなきゃあんたも逝くはめになるぞ。
msgctxt "RGN2_060"
msgid ""
"He's gone far beyond any level where you can save him.\n"
"Seriously, if you don't move, I'll kill you, too."
msgstr "Він давно перетнув межу, за якою його ще можна було врятувати.\nСерйозно, не відійдеш — я вб'ю і тебе."

#. Key: RGN2_061
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どくわけにはいかないの……
#. JA:   この人に対する責任は全て私が負うわ。
#. JA:   それにもう、覚悟は決めてるもの……。
#. JA: どくわけにはいかないの……。
#. JA:   この人に対する責任は全て私が負うわ。
#. JA:   それにもう、覚悟は決めてるもの……。
msgctxt "RGN2_061"
msgid ""
"I can't step aside... I will take full responsibility for his actions.\n"
"And, this is something I have already decided..."
msgstr "Я не можу відступити... Я візьму повну відповідальність за його вчинки.\nЯ вже все вирішила..."

#. Key: RGN2_062
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: それに……わかってないのは貴方も同じでしょ！
#. JA:   貴方、ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジよね。
#. JA:   蒼の魔道書のこと、何も知らないくせに！
#. JA: それに……わかってないのは貴方も同じでしょ！
#. JA:   貴方、ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジよね。
#. JA:   「蒼」の魔道書のこと、何も知らないくせに！
msgctxt "RGN2_062"
msgid ""
"Besides, I can say the same about your ignorance!\n"
"You're Ragna the Bloodedge, right?\n"
"Do you know anything about that grimoire you're carrying!?"
msgstr ""
"До того ж ви й самі нічого не розумієте! Ви ж Раґна Бладедж, так? Ви хоч\n"
"щось знаєте про гримуар, який носите!?"

#. Key: RGN2_063
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おい、てめぇ……マジで殺すぞ……。
msgctxt "RGN2_063"
msgid "You better choose your words wisely..."
msgstr "Добирай слова обережніше..."

#. Key: RGN2_064
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……お願い。
msgctxt "RGN2_064"
msgid "...Please..."
msgstr "...Прошу..."

#. Key: RGN2_066
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あーもう、はいはい、わかったよ、わかりました！
#. JA: あーもう。
#. JA:   はいはい、わかったよ、わかりました！
msgctxt "RGN2_066"
msgid "Ahhh, geez. OK, OK. I got it. You can have it your way."
msgstr "А-а, чорт із тобою. Гаразд, гаразд. Я зрозумів. Роби по-своєму."

#. Key: RGN2_067
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: だからそんな眼で見ないでくれ。
#. JA:   なんか俺が悪人みたいじゃねーかよ。
msgctxt "RGN2_067"
msgid "So don't gimme that look. You're makin' me look like the bad guy."
msgstr "І не дивися на мене так. Виставляєш мене лиходієм."

#. Key: RGN2_068
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あら、貴方大悪党じゃないの？
msgctxt "RGN2_068"
msgid "Oh? Aren't you that wanted vicious criminal?"
msgstr "О? Хіба ви не той небезпечний злочинець у розшуку?"

#. Key: RGN2_069
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: はいはい、なんとでも思ってくれ。
msgctxt "RGN2_069"
msgid "Yeah, yeah, whatever you say..."
msgstr "Ага-ага, як скажеш..."

#. Key: RGN2_070
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: んじゃ、俺はもう行くからな、そこのボロ雑巾、任せたぜ。
#. JA:   捨てるんなら燃えないゴミの日にしろよ。いや、生ゴミか？
msgctxt "RGN2_070"
msgid ""
"All right, I'm takin' off, so that dirty rag is all yours.\n"
"If it gets out of hand, make sure you toss him in the incinerator. Or is it the compost\n"
"heap?"
msgstr ""
"Гаразд, я пішов, а ця гидота твоя. Якщо він зірветься з ланцюга, кинь\n"
"його в піч. Чи краще на компост?"

#. Key: RGN2_071
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ラグナ……。
msgctxt "RGN2_071"
msgid "Ragna..."
msgstr "Раґно..."

#. Key: RGN2_072
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あん？
msgctxt "RGN2_072"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Га?"

#. Key: RGN2_073
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Litchi
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……ありがとう。優しいのね。
msgctxt "RGN2_073"
msgid "...Thanks... You're a lot nicer than I thought."
msgstr "...Дякую... Ви значно добріший, ніж я гадала."

#. Key: RGN2_074
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: よしてくれ……。
msgctxt "RGN2_074"
msgid "Save it..."
msgstr "Облиш..."

#. Key: RGN2_076
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 振り返らず、俺は軽く右手を振ってその場を後にした。
msgctxt "RGN2_076"
msgid "I give the girl a single wave good-bye and leave."
msgstr "Я махаю дівчині на прощання й іду."

#. Key: RGN2_077
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 今までに何度となく見てきた、あれに触れちまった奴の
#. JA:   なれの果て…。奴らの終焉は必ず……。
#. JA:   あのねーちゃんが望む結末を俺はまだ見たことはなかった。
#. JA: 今までに何度となく見てきた、あれに触れちまった奴のなれの果てを。
#. JA:   奴らの終焉は必ず……。
#. JA:   あのねーちゃんが望むような結末を俺はまだ見たことはなかった。
msgctxt "RGN2_077"
msgid ""
"I've seen what happens to people that thing eats many times, but I gotta see \n"
"what that girl's up to..."
msgstr ""
"Я не раз бачив, що стається з людьми, яких пожирає ця штука, але хочу\n"
"побачити, що задумала та дівчина..."

#. Key: RGN2_078
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ま、頑張れよな…。
#. JA: ま、頑張れよな……。
msgctxt "RGN2_078"
msgid "Good luck..."
msgstr "Щасти..."

#. Key: RGN2_079
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺は誰に聞かせるでもなく、呟いた。
msgctxt "RGN2_079"
msgid "I mutter something no one else can hear."
msgstr "Я бурмочу це так тихо, що ніхто не чує."

#. Key: RGN3_001
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 下層を抜け、一般市街である中層部に辿りついたころには、既に辺りは真っ暗になっていた。今夜は雲が多く、差し込む月明かりも少ないため、、自分の足元さえ見えない。
#. JA: 下層を抜け、一般市街である中層部に辿りついたころには、既に辺りは真っ暗になっていた。今夜は雲が多く、差し込む月明かりが少ない。
#. JA:   凝視しても自分の足元さえ見えない。
msgctxt "RGN3_001"
msgid ""
"By the time I reach the central levels, the sun's already long gone. The fog is thick as\n"
"hell...the moonlight doesn't even reach where I am. I can barely see my own feet..."
msgstr ""
"Коли я дістався центральних рівнів, сонце вже давно сіло. Туман густий,\n"
"як хрін зна що... місячне світло сюди не пробивається. Я ледве бачу\n"
"власні ноги..."

#. Key: RGN3_002
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: しかし、夜間は俺にとって好都合だった。
#. JA:   目的地はこの先の統制機構カグツチ支部。
#. JA:   夜は多少なりとも警備が手薄になる。
#. JA: しかし、夜間は俺にとって好都合だった。
#. JA:   夜は多少なりとも警備が手薄になる。
msgctxt "RGN3_002"
msgid ""
"...Although I ain't complaining. The night and the fog are actually pretty convenient...\n"
"Everyone drops their guard at night... Everyone."
msgstr ""
"...Хоча я не скаржуся. Ніч і туман мені навіть на руку... Уночі всі\n"
"втрачають пильність... Усі."

#. Key: RGN3_003
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 脇目も振らず、まっすぐに統制機構カグツチ支部へと足を向ける。
#. JA:   ここをぶっ潰せば、俺の目的はまた一歩前進する。
#. JA: 目的地はこの先の統制機構カグツチ支部。
#. JA:   俺は脇目も振らず、まっすぐに目的地へと足を向けた。
#. JA:   ここをぶっ潰せば、俺の目的はまた一歩前進する。
msgctxt "RGN3_003"
msgid ""
"The Kagutsuchi Library branch is right up ahead. I can almost smell the stink of it.\n"
"If I trash this one too, I'll be that much closer to wrapping this whole thing up."
msgstr ""
"Відділення Бібліотеки Каґуцучі вже попереду. Я майже відчуваю його\n"
"сморід. Розтрощу і його — стану ще на крок ближче до завершення цієї\n"
"справи."

#. Key: RGN3_004
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そーいや、これまで幾つの支部を潰したっけな？
#. JA:   ……ま、壊した数を覚えてても意味もねーか。
#. JA:   どうせ、あるだけ全部、ぶっ潰すだけだし。
msgctxt "RGN3_004"
msgid ""
"Now that I think about it, how many branches have I destroyed?\n"
"...Then again, I guess it doesn't really matter. I'm gonna destroy them all, anyway."
msgstr ""
"До речі, скільки відділень я вже знищив? ...Та яка різниця. Я все одно\n"
"знищу їх усі."

#. Key: RGN3_005
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 月が雲間から顔を覗かせたのか、俄かに周囲が明るくなった。
#. JA:   つい、その明るさに目を細めてしまう。
#. JA: 月が雲間から顔を覗かせたのか、俄かに周囲が明るくなった。
#. JA:   その明るさに一瞬目を細めてしまった。
msgctxt "RGN3_005"
msgid "I dunno if it was the moon or what, but...it got real bright there for a second."
msgstr "Не знаю, місяць це був чи ще щось... але на мить стало дуже світло."

#. Key: RGN3_006
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 月明かりってこんな眩しかったっけか……。
msgctxt "RGN3_006"
msgid "Is the moon always this bright...?"
msgstr "Місяць завжди такий яскравий...?"

#. Key: RGN3_007
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そう言えばガキの頃に住んでいた教会。
#. JA:   あの辺りの夜も、こんな感じで月が明るかったなぁと思いだす。
#. JA: ふと、ガキの頃に住んでいた教会を思い出す。
#. JA:   あの辺りの夜もこんな感じで月が明るかったなぁ……。
msgctxt "RGN3_007"
msgid ""
"The moonlight reminds me of the church in the old neighborhood.\n"
"The moon was always real bright there."
msgstr ""
"Місячне світло нагадує мені церкву біля нашого старого дому. Там\n"
"місяць теж завжди світив дуже яскраво."

#. Key: RGN3_008
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そういやあいつ、月が怖いとかいってたよな……。
#. JA:   なんか「月が落ちてくる～」とかいっていつも泣いてたっけか。
msgctxt "RGN3_008"
msgid ""
"That reminds me... He always used to say how he was scared of the moon...\n"
"He would always come to me saying, <DQ>the moon's gonna fall<DQ> or something like that."
msgstr ""
"До речі... Він постійно казав, що боїться місяця... Завжди прибігав до\n"
"мене зі словами на кшталт: «місяць зараз упаде»."

#. Key: RGN3_009
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 脳裏に甦る、森の中。古く小さな教会。
#. JA:   俺をそう呼ぶ、弟と妹の声――――
#. JA: 脳裏に甦る、森の中。古く小さな教会。
#. JA:   俺をそう呼ぶ、弟と妹の声―――
msgctxt "RGN3_009"
msgid "In my memories...I can hear them calling me..."
msgstr "У спогадах... я чую, як вони кличуть мене..."

#. Key: RGN3_010
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ――――兄さん――――
#. JA: ―――兄さん―――
msgctxt "RGN3_010"
msgid "Brother..."
msgstr "Братику..."

#. Key: RGN3_011
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Saya
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ――――兄さま――――
#. JA: ―――兄さま―――
msgctxt "RGN3_011"
msgid "Brother..."
msgstr "Братику..."

#. Key: RGN3_012
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: くそったれ。何を思い出に浸ってんだよ、俺は。
msgctxt "RGN3_012"
msgid "Goddammit, why do I keep thinking about that?"
msgstr "Чорт забирай, чому я постійно про це думаю?"

#. Key: RGN3_013
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 苛立ち、足下の石を蹴飛ばした。
#. JA: 妙な苛立ちを覚えて、俺は足下の石を蹴飛ばした。
msgctxt "RGN3_013"
msgid ""
"Gah! Screw this...\n"
"I kick a rock as hard as I can, and it skitters across the ground."
msgstr "Аргх! До біса... Я щосили б'ю камінь ногою, і той котиться землею."

#. Key: RGN3_017
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: くだらない思い出に浸っている間に、目的地に着いていた。
#. JA:   相変わらず、胸くそ悪い鋼の扉で入り口は固く閉ざされている。
#. JA:   どうやら術式で封じられているようだ。
#. JA: くだらない思い出に浸っている間に、目的地に着いていた。
#. JA:   相変わらず胸くそ悪い鋼の扉で、入り口は固く閉ざされている。
#. JA:   どうやら術式で封じられているようだ。
msgctxt "RGN3_017"
msgid ""
"I'm so busy thinkin' about my past, I almost run into the damn door. It's a big steel\n"
"piece of shit, and it looks like they put some sorta Armagus seal on it too."
msgstr ""
"Поки я поринав у дурні спогади, то вже дістався місця. Вхід, як завжди,\n"
"наглухо перегороджують ці паскудні сталеві двері. Схоже, їх запечатано\n"
"магічною формулою."

#. Key: RGN3_018
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 統制機構の門の扉には、触れるだけで人間を消し炭に変えるほどに強力な防御方陣がかけられている。毎度のことだ。
#. JA: 統制機構の門扉には、触れるだけで人間を消し炭に変えるほどの強力な防御方陣が施されている。まあ、毎度のことだが……。
msgctxt "RGN3_018"
msgid ""
"The Ars they put on these things could turn a guy into pulp in a matter of seconds...\n"
"This one's no different."
msgstr ""
"На воротах Організації Контролю стоїть такий потужний захисний\n"
"бар’єр, що від самого дотику перетворить людину на обвуглену\n"
"головешку. Як завжди..."

#. Key: RGN3_019
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ったく、あぶねえよな……。
msgctxt "RGN3_019"
msgid "Damn, that was close..."
msgstr "Чорт, мало не вляпався..."

#. Key: RGN3_020
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: スッと、右手を差し出し解除の術式を唱える。
#. JA:   まあ、解除と言っても強引に打ち破るモノだが……。
msgctxt "RGN3_020"
msgid ""
"It takes my right hand and me a couple seconds to pump out our own unlocking Ars.\n"
"...All right, maybe <DQ>unlocking<DQ> isn't quite accurate. It's a little more like <DQ>kicking\n"
"down<DQ>..."
msgstr ""
"Я простягаю праву руку й промовляю формулу зняття печаті. Хоча яке\n"
"там «зняття» — я просто ламаю її силою..."

#. Key: RGN3_021
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あれ？
#. JA:   術式が……かかってねぇ……。
#. JA: あれ？　術式が……かかってねぇ……。
msgctxt "RGN3_021"
msgid "Huh? There's no..."
msgstr "Га? Тут немає..."

#. Key: RGN3_022
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 訝しげに思いつつも、両手で重い扉を開ける。
#. JA:   案の定、何の問題もなく扉は開いた。
#. JA:   中は薄暗闇が広がっていてよく見えない。
#. JA: 訝しげに思いつつ、両手で重い扉を押した。
#. JA:   案の定、何の問題も抵抗もなく扉は簡単に開いた。
#. JA:   中を窺う。薄暗闇が広がっているだけでよく見えなかった。
msgctxt "RGN3_022"
msgid ""
"Something doesn't feel right...but hell, does it ever? I put both hands on the door\n"
"and shove. It swings open easily enough...\n"
"Damn, it's dark in here... I can barely see."
msgstr ""
"Щось не так... хоча коли тут усе було нормально? Я впираюся в двері\n"
"обома руками й штовхаю. Вони легко відчиняються... Чорт, тут темно...\n"
"Майже нічого не видно."

#. Key: RGN3_023
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 妙……だな。
msgctxt "RGN3_023"
msgid "That's...strange."
msgstr "Це... дивно."

#. Key: RGN3_024
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 人の気配を感じない。俺は逆に少し警戒心を強めた。
#. JA:   大体いつもならこの門に辿り着く前に二、三回はお出迎えがある筈だった。
#. JA: 人の気配を感じない。俺は逆に少し警戒心を強めた。
#. JA:   大体いつもならこの門に辿り着くまでに
#. JA:   ２～３回はお出迎えがあるのが常だった。
msgctxt "RGN3_024"
msgid "OK, something's up... I should've run into a couple groups of soldiers by now..."
msgstr ""
"Гаразд, тут точно щось не так... Я вже мав зустріти кілька загонів\n"
"солдатів..."

#. Key: RGN3_025
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN3_025"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RGN3_026
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: はーい、死神さんのお出ましだよ～！
#. JA:   皆さんを大霊界にご招待にあがりましたよ～！
msgctxt "RGN3_026"
msgid ""
"Hello! Mr. Grim Reaper is here!\n"
"I've come to invite all you guys to the underworld!"
msgstr "Агов! Пан Жнець прийшов! Хочу запросити вас усіх до пекла!"

#. Key: RGN3_028
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: すみません～。
#. JA:   ピザお持ちしました～～～。
#. JA: すみません～、
#. JA:   ピザお持ちしました～～～。
msgctxt "RGN3_028"
msgid ""
"Excuse me!\n"
"Pizza delivery here!"
msgstr "Перепрошую! Доставка піци!"

#. Key: RGN3_030
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 罠……じゃねぇみたいだな……。
#. JA:   一体どうなってやがる？
msgctxt "RGN3_030"
msgid ""
"Well, it doesn't look like a trap...\n"
"What the hell's goin' on?"
msgstr "На пастку не схоже... Що тут, у біса, коїться?"

#. Key: RGN3_031
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ゆっくりと奥に進んでいくと、また大きな扉があった。
#. JA:   その扉は少し開いていて隙間からは光が漏れている。
#. JA: やや警戒を強めながらゆっくりと奥に進んでいくと、
#. JA:   また大きな扉があった。少し開いた隙間から光が漏れ出している。
msgctxt "RGN3_031"
msgid ""
"I tighten my grip on my sword and keep moving.\n"
"There's another huge set of doors in front of me, but these are open a crack, and a\n"
"sliver of light spills out from between them."
msgstr ""
"Я міцніше стискаю меч і йду далі. Попереду ще одні величезні двері, але\n"
"вони трохи привідчинені, і крізь щілину пробивається смуга світла."

#. Key: RGN3_032
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ま、造りはどこも大して変わんねーな。
msgctxt "RGN3_032"
msgid "Well, I guess it's not too different from the other branches."
msgstr "Що ж, від інших відділень воно майже не відрізняється."

#. Key: RGN3_033
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 誰かいるのか――――？
#. JA:   なぜか胸騒ぎがする。俺は慎重に扉へ手をかけた。
#. JA: 誰かいるのか―――？
#. JA:   なぜか胸騒ぎがした。俺は慎重に扉へ手をかける。
msgctxt "RGN3_033"
msgid ""
"Is there someone there...?\n"
"For some reason my heart's beating a mile a goddamn minute.\n"
"I put my hand on the door."
msgstr ""
"Там хтось є...? Чомусь серце калатає, наче божевільне. Я кладу руку на\n"
"двері."

#. Key: RGN3_035
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おおおおおおおおおおおお！！！！
msgctxt "RGN3_035"
msgid "RAAAAAAAAAARGH!"
msgstr "А-А-А-А-А-А-АРГХ!"

#. Key: RGN3_036
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 雄叫びを上げながら、俺は右腕で剣を振るった。
#. JA: 俺は雄叫びを上げながら突進し、右腕で剣を振るった。
msgctxt "RGN3_036"
msgid ""
"I throw the door open with a yell, swinging my sword in a wide arc as I leap into\n"
"the room—\n"
msgstr ""
"З криком я розчиняю двері й, застрибуючи до кімнати, широко\n"
"замахуюся мечем—\n"

#. Key: RGN3_037
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: バキン！！！
msgctxt "RGN3_037"
msgid "Clink!"
msgstr "Дзень!"

#. Key: RGN3_038
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺の剣を受け止めた細い刀身の向こうで、
#. JA:   不気味な笑みを浮かべている男――――
#. JA: 俺の剣を受け止め、
#. JA:   細い刀身の向こうで不気味な笑みを浮かべている男―――
msgctxt "RGN3_038"
msgid ""
"My sword stops short, and I can see it resting on the thin blade of a katana. The\n"
"person on the other side of the katana lets out a laugh that sends a shiver down my\n"
"spine."
msgstr ""
"Мій меч зупиняється, упершись у тонке лезо катани. Той, хто стоїть по\n"
"інший бік катани, сміється — від цього сміху в мене мороз іде шкірою."

#. Key: RGN3_039
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ククク……これが挨拶代わりかい。
#. JA:   相変わらずだね、兄さん。
msgctxt "RGN3_039"
msgid ""
"*chuckle*...Is that how you greet people?\n"
"Boy, you never change, do you...?"
msgstr "*сміється*... Так ти вітаєшся з людьми? Ти зовсім не змінився, правда...?"

#. Key: RGN3_040
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……ジン！
#. JA:   どうしてテメェがここにいる！！
msgctxt "RGN3_040"
msgid ""
"...Jin!\n"
"Why the hell are you here!?"
msgstr "...Джіне! Якого біса ти тут робиш!?"

#. Key: RGN3_041
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どうしてって。
#. JA:   兄さんを待っていたに決まってるじゃないか。
msgctxt "RGN3_041"
msgid ""
"<DQ>Why<DQ>?\n"
"Heh, I thought that was obvious...\n"
"I came to see you, Ragna."
msgstr ""
"«Якого»? Хе, мені здавалося, це очевидно... Я прийшов побачити тебе,\n"
"Раґно."

#. Key: RGN3_042
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺を……待ってた――――だと？
#. JA: 俺を……待ってた―――だと？
msgctxt "RGN3_042"
msgid "You were...waiting for me?"
msgstr "Ти... чекав на мене?"

#. Key: RGN3_043
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そうだよ。アハハ、でも凄いね、兄さんは。
#. JA:   史上最高額の賞金首。
#. JA:   全世界の統制機構支部を恐怖させる、死神。
msgctxt "RGN3_043"
msgid ""
"Mmhmm...\n"
"Still, I am pretty amazed...\n"
"You have the highest bounty on record...\n"
"The NOL practically rules the world, and they're still afraid of you... The Reaper..."
msgstr ""
"Ага... І все ж я вражений... За твою голову призначено найбільшу\n"
"нагороду в історії... Організація Контролю майже править світом, але й\n"
"вона боїться тебе... Жнеця..."

#. Key: RGN3_044
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 今じゃ、誰もが知っているよ。子供でさえも。
#. JA:   「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」の名を――――ね？
#. JA: 今じゃ、誰もが知っているよ。子供でさえも。
#. JA:   「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」の名を―――ね。
msgctxt "RGN3_044"
msgid ""
"Ask anyone on the street...\n"
"And they'll know the name...\n"
" <DQ>Ragna the Bloodedge<DQ>..."
msgstr "Запитай будь-кого на вулиці... І кожен знатиме ім'я... «Раґна Бладедж»..."

#. Key: RGN3_045
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そんなことは、どうでもいい！
msgctxt "RGN3_045"
msgid "I could care less about that!"
msgstr "Мені начхати!"

#. Key: RGN3_046
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: でも、おかしいね、兄さん？
#. JA:   兄さん術式使えなかった筈じゃ……。
#. JA:   ハハ、もしかしてそれも「蒼」の魔道書の力ってやつなの？
msgctxt "RGN3_046"
msgid ""
"Hahaha... But that's strange, Brother...\n"
"I didn't think you had the aptitude to use Armagus.\n"
"Or does it have something to do with that Azure Grimoire?"
msgstr ""
"Ха-ха... Але це дивно, братику... Я ж думав, що ти не вмієш\n"
"користуватися магічними формулами... Чи це теж сила «Лазурного»\n"
"гримуара?"

#. Key: RGN3_047
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うるせぇ……。
#. JA:   テメェには聞かなきゃいけねぇ事が山ほどある。
#. JA:   だが……。
msgctxt "RGN3_047"
msgid ""
"Shut up...! I've got a ton of questions...for you.\n"
"But..."
msgstr "Заткнися...! У мене до тебе купа запитань. Але..."

#. Key: RGN3_048
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: だが？
msgctxt "RGN3_048"
msgid "But...?"
msgstr "Але...?"

#. Key: RGN3_049
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: その前に一回ぶった切らせろ！！！
#. JA: その前に一回ぶった斬らせろ！！！
msgctxt "RGN3_049"
msgid "I think I'll beat the answers out of you, instead!"
msgstr "Краще я виб'ю з тебе відповіді!"

#. Key: RGN3_050
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ははははははは！！！
#. JA:   いいね、いいよ、この感覚！
#. JA:   最高だ、堪らないよ、兄さん！！！
#. JA: ははははははは！！！
#. JA:   いいね、いいよ、この感覚！
#. JA:   最高だ、堪<ruby>たま</ruby>らないよ、兄さん！！！
msgctxt "RGN3_050"
msgid ""
"Hahahahaha!\n"
"I love it... This is great!\n"
"What a reunion, eh, Brother?"
msgstr "Ха-ха-ха-ха! Обожнюю це... Як чудово! Оце возз'єднання, еге ж, братику?"

#. Key: RGN3_051
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ジン、テメェ……！
msgctxt "RGN3_051"
msgid "Jin, you bastard."
msgstr "Джіне, виродку."

#. Key: RGN3_052
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: さあ、おいで兄さん……。
#. JA:   また、殺してあげるからさ……。
msgctxt "RGN3_052"
msgid "Haha, give it your best shot... I'll be happy to kill you again!"
msgstr "Ха-ха, постарайся... Я з радістю вб'ю тебе ще раз!"

#. Key: RGN3_056
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ジン……テメェ……テメェなんぞに……！
msgctxt "RGN3_056"
msgid "How... How did I lose...to you...!"
msgstr "Як... Як я міг програти... тобі...!"

#. Key: RGN3_057
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 兄さん、こんなんじゃ期待はずれも良いところだよ。
#. JA:   ……どうして「蒼」の魔道書を使わないんだい？
#. JA:   まさか手加減したなんてことは、なしだからね……。
#. JA: 兄さん、こんなんじゃ期待外れも良いところだよ。
#. JA:   ……どうして「蒼」の魔道書を使わないんだい？
#. JA:   まさか手加減したなんてことは、なしだからね……。
msgctxt "RGN3_057"
msgid ""
"Brother... Don't tell me this is all you've got.\n"
"...Why don't you use that Azure Grimoire of yours?\n"
"You weren't holding back, were you?"
msgstr ""
"Братику... Не кажи, що це все. ...Чому не скористаєшся своїм Лазурним\n"
"Гримуаром? Ти ж не піддавався, правда?"

#. Key: RGN3_058
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: クソが……。
msgctxt "RGN3_058"
msgid "AAAGH! You piece of shit..."
msgstr "А-А-АРГХ! Ах ти ж гнида..."

#. Key: RGN3_059
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ククククク……。
#. JA:   そんなことだとまた僕に殺されちゃうよ。
msgctxt "RGN3_059"
msgid "Hahahaha... I guess... You're just gonna die to me again..."
msgstr "Ха-ха-ха... Схоже... ти знову помреш від моєї руки..."

#. Key: RGN3_064
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……どうしたんだい、兄さん。
#. JA:   とどめを刺さないのかい……？
msgctxt "RGN3_064"
msgid ""
"...What's the matter, Brother? Hahaha...\n"
"You're not gonna finish me off...?"
msgstr "...Що таке, братику? Ха-ха... Не збираєшся мене добивати...?"

#. Key: RGN3_065
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: テメェにはまだ聞きたいことがある。
#. JA:   それに今回の目的はテメェじゃねーんだよ。
#. JA:   死にたきゃ、勝手に死んでろ。
msgctxt "RGN3_065"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I need answers.\n"
"Besides, I'm not here for you, anyway.\n"
"If you wanna die on your own, then be my guest."
msgstr ""
"Я вже сказав: мені потрібні відповіді. До того ж я прийшов не за тобою.\n"
"Хочеш здохнути сам — будь ласка."

#. Key: RGN3_066
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 甘い、甘いよ、兄さんは……。
#. JA:   ハハハ。だから守れないんだよ……何も……何もね……。
msgctxt "RGN3_066"
msgid ""
"Soft... You're too soft, Brother...\n"
"Hahaha... That's why you can't protect anything...or anyone..."
msgstr ""
"М'який... Ти надто м'який, братику... Ха-ха... Тому й не здатен захистити\n"
"нічого... і нікого..."

#. Key: RGN3_067
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ゴスッ！
msgctxt "RGN3_067"
msgid "Thwack!"
msgstr "Хряп!"

#. Key: RGN3_068
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: グハッ……ウッ！
msgctxt "RGN3_068"
msgid "Guagh! Ugh..."
msgstr "А-ах! Кх..."

#. Key: RGN3_069
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 黙って寝てろ、このクソガキ、月が落ちてくるぞ……。
#. JA: 黙って寝てろ、このクソガキ。
#. JA:   月が落ちてくるぞ……。
msgctxt "RGN3_069"
msgid ""
"Shut up and stay down.\n"
"Oh, and watch out...or the moon might fall..."
msgstr "Замовкни й лежи. І будь обережний... бо місяць іще впаде..."

#. Key: RGN3_071
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN3_071"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RGN3_072
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: クソックソックソッ！　馬鹿野郎か俺は！
#. JA:   何でこんなに甘いんだ！！！
msgctxt "RGN3_072"
msgid "Tch! Shit...Shit...Shit! I'm a goddamn idiot! Why the hell am I so soft with him!?"
msgstr ""
"Тьху! Лайно... Лайно... Лайно! Я довбаний ідіот! Чому я такий м'який із\n"
"ним!?"

#. Key: RGN3_073
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ゴン！！！
msgctxt "RGN3_073"
msgid "Bam!"
msgstr "Бам!"

#. Key: RGN3_074
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 拳に痛みが走るのと同時に冷たい壁が乾いた音をたてた。
#. JA:   拳に伝わる鈍い痛みも今は気にならなかった――――。
#. JA: 拳に痛みが走るのと同時に冷たい壁が乾いた音をたてた。
#. JA:   手指を軋ませる鈍い痛みも、今は気にならなかった―――。
msgctxt "RGN3_074"
msgid "Pain shoots through my hand, but I hear a loud noise echo off the cold walls, and the pain in my hand doesn't feel so bad anymore..."
msgstr ""
"Руку пронизує біль, але холодними стінами розноситься гучний удар, і\n"
"біль уже не здається таким сильним..."

#. Key: RGN3_079
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……興ざめだぜ、ったく。
msgctxt "RGN3_079"
msgid "...Finally..."
msgstr "...Нарешті..."

#. Key: RGN3_080
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あのなれの果てをかばう女の目が忘れられない。
#. JA:   正直、俺はああいう目が苦手だ。
#. JA:   真っ直ぐすぎて居心地が悪くなる。
msgctxt "RGN3_080"
msgid ""
"I can't forget the eyes of the chick who tried to keep me from killing that monster.\n"
"I'm no match for those eyes... Straightforward, honest, pure... \n"
"They just make me feel...uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"Я не можу забути очі дівчини, яка не дала мені вбити те чудовисько.\n"
"Проти таких очей я безсилий... Прямих, чесних, чистих... Від них мені\n"
"просто... не по собі."

#. Key: RGN3_081
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺も相当甘いな……。
#. JA:   ちっ、イラつくぜ……って、あ。
msgctxt "RGN3_081"
msgid ""
"I guess I'm pretty soft, after all. Tch...now that pisses me off.\n"
"...Huh?"
msgstr "Схоже, я й справді надто м'який. Тьху... Аж бісить. ...Га?"

#. Key: RGN3_082
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 考え事しながら歩いてたせいで繁華街に出てしまった。
#. JA:   一応賞金首だし、人の多い場所は避けるようにしているのだが……。
#. JA: 考え事しながら歩いてたせいで繁華街に出てしまった。
#. JA:   一応賞金首だ。人の多い場所は避けるようにしているのだが……。
msgctxt "RGN3_082"
msgid ""
"I'm so busy thinkin' about shit that I don't realize I've ended up in the business\n"
"district. I -am- a wanted man... Maybe I shouldn't be around crowds..."
msgstr ""
"Я так задумався, що не помітив, як опинився в торговому районі. Я\n"
"все-таки в розшуку... Може, не варто ходити поміж людей..."

#. Key: RGN3_083
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なんだこの街……。
msgctxt "RGN3_083"
msgid "What's up with this town...?"
msgstr "Що не так із цим містом...?"

#. Key: RGN3_084
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 通り過ぎる人々は俺の顔をちらっと見るが、
#. JA:   興味無さそうにそのまま通り過ぎてしまう。
msgctxt "RGN3_084"
msgid "People look at my face, but then just keep moving..."
msgstr "Люди дивляться мені в обличчя й просто йдуть далі..."

#. Key: RGN3_085
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: （迷彩術式、今かけて無いよな？）
#. JA: （迷彩術式、今かけてないよな？）
msgctxt "RGN3_085"
msgid "(Did I put on a Camouflage Armagus?)"
msgstr "(На мені ж зараз немає формули маскування?)"

#. Key: RGN3_086
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……ま、いいか、腹も減ったし、なんか喰ってくか。
#. JA: ……ま、いいか、腹も減ったし、なんか食ってくか。
msgctxt "RGN3_086"
msgid "...Oh well, I was pretty hungry anyways. I guess I'll grab a bite to eat."
msgstr "...Та байдуже, я ще й так зголоднів. Піду щось перекушу."

#. Key: RGN3_087
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ちょっとそこ行く白くてバカっぽそうな人。
#. JA:   待つニャス。
msgctxt "RGN3_087"
msgid ""
"Hey, white-haired guy over there who looks kinda stupid!\n"
"Wait!"
msgstr "Гей, білявий дурнику! Зачекай!"

#. Key: RGN3_088
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN3_088"
msgid "...?"
msgstr "...?"

#. Key: RGN3_089
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 聞こえて無いニャスか？
#. JA:   ん～おかしいニャス……。
#. JA: 聞こえてないニャスか？
#. JA:   ん～おかしいニャス……。
msgctxt "RGN3_089"
msgid ""
"Can't you hear me?\n"
"Hmm... That's strange..."
msgstr "Ти мене не чуєш? Дивно..."

#. Key: RGN3_090
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 白くて馬鹿っぽそうで間抜け面な人って
#. JA:   他に見当たらないニャス……。
#. JA: 白くて馬鹿っぽそうで間抜け顔な人って
#. JA:   他に見当たらないニャス……。
msgctxt "RGN3_090"
msgid ""
"Hmm... I don't see any other stupid looking guys\n"
"with bleach-white hair, who probably don't do well with the ladies..."
msgstr ""
"Гм... Не бачу інших дурнуватих білявців, яким напевно не щастить із\n"
"дівчатами..."

#. Key: RGN3_091
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: んだとテメェ！　つか形容詞が増えてっぞ！
msgctxt "RGN3_091"
msgid "The hell'd you say!? I think you added some adjectives in that second one!"
msgstr "Що ти сказала!? Вдруге прикметників побільшало!"

#. Key: RGN3_092
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おお！　やっぱ白くてバカっぽそうなのはオマエにゃすか！
#. JA:   ご飯食べさせてほしいニャス。
msgctxt "RGN3_092"
msgid ""
"Ooh! I knew you were the stupid looking white-haired guy!\n"
"I'm hungry. Feed me!"
msgstr "О! Я знала, що ти той дурнуватий білявець! Я голодна. Нагодуй мене!"

#. Key: RGN3_093
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なんで俺がテメェに
#. JA:   飯、奢らなきゃいけねぇんだ！！！
msgctxt "RGN3_093"
msgid "And why the hell would I do that!?"
msgstr "І якого біса я маю це робити!?"

#. Key: RGN3_094
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ん～おかしいニャス……。
#. JA:   さっきウサギの人にご飯くれって言ったら……。
msgctxt "RGN3_094"
msgid ""
"Hmm... That's strange...\n"
"I asked that rabbit person to give me some food..."
msgstr "Гм... Дивно... Я попросила кролицю дати мені їжі..."

#. Key: RGN3_095
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ウサギの人……？
msgctxt "RGN3_095"
msgid "Rabbit person...?"
msgstr "Кролицю...?"

#. Key: RGN3_096
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うん、そしたらな――――
#. JA: うん、そしたらな―――
msgctxt "RGN3_096"
msgid "Uh-huh, and she said..."
msgstr "Ага, і вона сказала..."

#. Key: RGN3_098
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: まぁ、見た目は貧相だけれど、
#. JA:   鼻の下を伸ばして瀕死の化け物を見逃してあげる
#. JA:   「いい人」だから。貴方の願い、叶えてくれるわよ。
#. JA: まぁ、見た目は貧相だけれど、
#. JA:   鼻の下を伸ばして瀕死の化け物を見逃してあげる
#. JA:   “いい人”だから。貴方の願い、叶えてくれるわよ。
msgctxt "RGN3_098"
msgid ""
"He looks rather poor, but he was kind enough to let a monster roam free, so I\n"
"suppose he's a <DQ>good guy<DQ> by anyone's definition of the word."
msgstr ""
"Він виглядає бідним, але був досить добрим, щоб відпустити чудовисько,\n"
"тож за будь-якими мірками він «добрий чоловік»."

#. Key: RGN3_099
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: って、言ってたニャス～～。
#. JA:   なあ「いい人」！　タオにご飯おごってくれ。
#. JA: って、言ってたニャス～～。
#. JA:   なあ“いい人”！　タオにご飯おごってくれ。
msgctxt "RGN3_099"
msgid ""
"That's what she said!\n"
"C'mon, <DQ>good guy<DQ>, give me something to eat."
msgstr "Так вона й сказала! Ну ж бо, «добрий чоловіче», дай мені їсти."

#. Key: RGN3_100
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あ・の・ウ・サ・ギ……！
msgctxt "RGN3_100"
msgid "Goddamn rabbit...!"
msgstr "Клята кролиця...!"

#. Key: RGN3_101
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: む～～～！　
#. JA:   お腹すいたニャス、もう死にそうニャス……。
msgctxt "RGN3_101"
msgid ""
"Meow...\n"
"I'm hungry! I'm gonna starve to death!"
msgstr "Няв... Я голодна! Я помру з голоду!"

#. Key: RGN3_102
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: いい人はタオを見捨てて餓死させるつもりニャス……。
#. JA:   恨むニャス。呪ってやるニャス。化けて出てやるニャス……。
msgctxt "RGN3_102"
msgid ""
"A <DQ>good guy<DQ> is just gonna turn a blind eye and let me die?\n"
"I'll haunt you! Mark my words because I swear I will...!"
msgstr ""
"«Добрий чоловік» просто заплющить очі й дасть мені померти? Я тебе\n"
"переслідуватиму після смерті! Клянуся...!"

#. Key: RGN3_103
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: わーった、わーった。
#. JA:   化けて出て来られたらたまんねぇし。
msgctxt "RGN3_103"
msgid ""
"All right, all right...!\n"
"I don't think I wanna be haunted today..."
msgstr "Гаразд, гаразд...! Сьогодні я не хочу зустрічатися з привидами..."

#. Key: RGN3_104
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あーそーだな。んじゃこうしよう！
#. JA:   勝った方が飯を奢るってのはどうだ？
msgctxt "RGN3_104"
msgid ""
"OK, let's do this.\n"
"How about the winner buys lunch?"
msgstr "Домовимося так. Переможець купує обід."

#. Key: RGN3_105
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おお、なるほど、いい考えニャス！
#. JA:   覚悟はいいニャスか？　タオは強いニャスよ！
msgctxt "RGN3_105"
msgid ""
"Oh, great idea!\n"
"Are you ready for this? I'm pretty tough, you know!"
msgstr "О, чудова ідея! Готовий? Я дуже сильна!"

#. Key: RGN3_106
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: げ、マジかよ、冗談で言ったのに。
msgctxt "RGN3_106"
msgid "Guh!? Are you serious? I was just kidding."
msgstr "Га!? Ти серйозно? Я лише пожартував."

#. Key: RGN3_107
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: タオは大金持ちになるために辛くきびしー旅の途中ニャス。
#. JA:   だから手合わせは、ねがっちゃったりかなっちゃったりニャス。
#. JA: タオはオオガネモチになるために辛くきびしー旅の途中ニャス。
#. JA:   だから手合わせは、ねがっちゃったりかなっちゃったりニャス。
msgctxt "RGN3_107"
msgid ""
"Tao's on a long and hard journey to become rich.\n"
"So I was kinda hopin' for a match or two...or three...or four..."
msgstr ""
"Тао вирушила в довгу й тяжку путь до багатства. Тож я сподівалася на\n"
"один бій... чи два... три... чотири..."

#. Key: RGN3_108
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: わけわかんねぇから。
msgctxt "RGN3_108"
msgid "I don't get a word you're sayin'."
msgstr "Я не розумію ані слова."

#. Key: RGN3_109
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: いーくーニャ――――――――ス！
#. JA: いーくーニャ―――――――ス！
msgctxt "RGN3_109"
msgid "Heeeere I cooooome!"
msgstr "Я йду-у-у-у!"

#. Key: RGN3_113
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うにゃぁ……。こんなはずではにゃかったニャス……。
#. JA:   お腹ぺこぺこじゃなきゃ、タオ負けにゃかったのに……。
msgctxt "RGN3_113"
msgid ""
"Eek... That wasn't supposed to happen...\n"
"If I wasn't starving, I wouldn't have lost to you...!"
msgstr "Ой... Так не мало статися... Якби я не голодувала, то не програла б...!"

#. Key: RGN3_114
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おっし、んじゃ約束だからな。
msgctxt "RGN3_114"
msgid "All right. A promise is a promise."
msgstr "Гаразд. Обіцянка є обіцянка."

#. Key: RGN3_115
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うぅ……しかたないニャス……。
msgctxt "RGN3_115"
msgid "Mew... I guess there's no choice..."
msgstr "Няв... Схоже, вибору немає..."

#. Key: RGN3_117
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: モグモグムシャムシャ
msgctxt "RGN3_117"
msgid "Chomp chomp, chew chew"
msgstr "Хрум-хрум, ням-ням"

#. Key: RGN3_118
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 見事勝利を勝ち取った俺は、猫のおごりで料理にありついた。
#. JA:   最近面倒ごとが多くて、ろくな飯を食っていなかったからありがたい。
msgctxt "RGN3_118"
msgid ""
"I manage to get myself somethin' to eat after I beat up that cat...thing.\n"
"I've been knee-deep in shit lately... I haven't had the chance to just sit down and eat\n"
"a real meal in...hell, in forever."
msgstr ""
"Побивши ту кішку... чи хто вона там, я нарешті дістаю їжу. Останнім\n"
"часом я по вуха в лайні... Не пам'ятаю, коли востаннє міг просто сісти й\n"
"нормально поїсти."

#. Key: RGN3_119
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 炒飯、回鍋肉、餃子に肉まん。
#. JA:   おごりなのをいいことに、遠慮なく料理を注文する。
msgctxt "RGN3_119"
msgid "Well, no time like the present. Doesn't hurt that it's a free lunch..."
msgstr "Що ж, кращого часу не буде. Та й обід безплатний..."

#. Key: RGN3_120
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: こいつがそんなに金を持ってるとは思えなかったが、まーそれはお互い様ってことで。
#. JA: こいつがそんなに金を持ってるとは思えなかったが、
#. JA:   まーそれはお互い様ってことで。
msgctxt "RGN3_120"
msgid "Although...it doesn't look like that cat has much more money than I do..."
msgstr "Хоча... здається, у цієї кішки грошей не набагато більше, ніж у мене..."

#. Key: RGN3_121
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そういやさ……。
#. JA:   さっきオマエ大金持ちがどうしたこうした言ってたよな。
msgctxt "RGN3_121"
msgid "That reminds me... Earlier you said you were on a journey to become rich, right?"
msgstr "До речі... Ти казала, що подорожуєш, аби розбагатіти, так?"

#. Key: RGN3_122
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ムシャムシャ……ほぐ……。
#. JA:   ひょれほいりゅひゃひゅ。
msgctxt "RGN3_122"
msgid ""
"*chomp* *chomp* *swallow*\n"
"Yeah, take a look at this."
msgstr "*хрум* *хрум* *ковтає* Ага, поглянь на це."

#. Key: RGN3_123
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どんだけ詰め込んでんだよ……と思わず突っ込みたくなるほど頬を飯で膨らませた猫が、服の中からごそごそと一枚の紙を取り出した。
#. JA: どんだけ詰め込んでんだよ……と思わず突っ込みたくなるほど
#. JA:   頬を飯で膨らませた猫が、服の中からごそごそと一枚の紙を取り出した。
msgctxt "RGN3_123"
msgid ""
"The cat thing shoves the rest of the food into her mouth and swallows. I have to\n"
"admit, I'm a little worried she's gonna hurt herself, but she seems fine.\n"
"She digs a piece of paper out of her coat and hands it to me."
msgstr ""
"Кішка запихає до рота решту їжі й ковтає. Зізнаюся, я трохи боюся, що\n"
"вона вдавиться, але наче все гаразд. Вона дістає з одягу аркуш паперу й\n"
"дає мені."

#. Key: RGN3_124
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 喰ってから話せよ……。ん、なんだこりゃ？
#. JA:   ……つか誰だこれ？
#. JA: 食ってから話せよ……。ん、なんだこりゃ？
#. JA:   ……つか誰だこれ？
msgctxt "RGN3_124"
msgid ""
"Swallow, then talk...\n"
"Huh? What's this? Rather, who is this?"
msgstr "Спершу проковтни, потім говори... Га? Що це? Точніше, хто це?"

#. Key: RGN3_125
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ムシャムシャ……ゴックン。大悪党らぐにゃニャス。
#. JA:   タオはらぐにゃを捕まえていっぱいオカネもらうニャス。
msgctxt "RGN3_125"
msgid ""
"Mmph mrmph... *swallow*. He's the big bad villain Ragnya.\n"
"Tao's gonna beat up this Ragnya and collect a bunch of money."
msgstr ""
"М-мф... *ковтає*. Це страшний лиходій Раґня. Тао поб'є Раґню й отримає\n"
"купу грошей."

#. Key: RGN3_126
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ぶ――――――――――――――――！
#. JA: ぶ――――――――――――――！
msgctxt "RGN3_126"
msgid "Pffffft!"
msgstr "Пф-ф-ф-ф!"

#. Key: RGN3_127
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どうした、いい人？
#. JA:   ご飯もったいないニャスよ。
msgctxt "RGN3_127"
msgid ""
"What's the matter, good guy?\n"
"What a waste of food..."
msgstr "Що таке, добрий чоловіче? Їжу марнуєш..."

#. Key: RGN3_128
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: いや……なんでもねぇ……。
msgctxt "RGN3_128"
msgid "Uh...nothing at all..."
msgstr "Е-е... нічого..."

#. Key: RGN3_130
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: （これ……俺かよ……）
msgctxt "RGN3_130"
msgid "(...This is supposed to be me...?)"
msgstr "(...Це нібито я...?)"

#. Key: RGN3_131
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ま……いいか。
#. JA:   おい、俺はもう行くからな、あとの勘定よろしくな。
msgctxt "RGN3_131"
msgid ""
"Oh, well...\n"
"Hey, I'm takin' off, so take care of the bill for me."
msgstr "Ну гаразд... Гей, я пішов, тож розплатися за мене."

#. Key: RGN3_132
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ムシャムシャモグモグ。
#. JA:   ほぶ、ひゃひゃにゃ、ひひいほ。
msgctxt "RGN3_132"
msgid ""
"Mmph mrmph... *chew* *chew*\n"
"All righty... Good guy."
msgstr "М-мф... *жує* *жує* Добре... добрий чоловіче."

#. Key: RGN3_133
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……はぁ。
#. JA:   あんなのにも狙われてんのかよ。
msgctxt "RGN3_133"
msgid ""
"*sigh*\n"
"Even those <DQ>things<DQ> are after me, now?"
msgstr "*зітхає* Тепер навіть ці «створіння» полюють на мене?"

#. Key: RGN3_137
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: こんなガキに負けるとは……。
#. JA:   俺はここまで腑抜けてたのか。
msgctxt "RGN3_137"
msgid ""
"To lose to a little kid like her...\n"
"Am I getting that rusty?"
msgstr "Програти такій малій... Невже я настільки розгубив форму?"

#. Key: RGN3_138
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: やったニャス！
#. JA:   これでご飯にありつけるニャー！！
#. JA:   いい人、約束ニャス！　ご飯ニャス！
msgctxt "RGN3_138"
msgid ""
"Yayyyyy! Yayyyy!\n"
"Neow I got free food!\n"
"Good guy, you promised! Time to eat!"
msgstr ""
"Ура-а-а! Ура-а! Тепер у мене безплатна їжа! Добрий чоловіче, ти обіцяв!\n"
"Час їсти!"

#. Key: RGN3_139
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……負けは負けだしな。
#. JA:   しゃあねえ、俺も一緒に飯でも食うとするか。
msgctxt "RGN3_139"
msgid ""
"...A loss is a loss.\n"
"Fine, I guess I'll take a break myself."
msgstr "...Програш є програш. Гаразд, мабуть, і я трохи відпочину."

#. Key: RGN3_140
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: はぁーどうしたんだ俺？
#. JA:   こんなんじゃ……駄目だろ……。
msgctxt "RGN3_140"
msgid ""
"Ugh... What happened to me?\n"
"This isn't right..."
msgstr "Кх... Що зі мною сталося? Так не має бути..."

#. Key: RGN3_141
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どうした、いい人、いくニャスよ。
msgctxt "RGN3_141"
msgid "What's the matter, good guy?"
msgstr "Що таке, добрий чоловіче?"

#. Key: RGN3_142
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: はいはい、わーったよ、ちくしょう。
msgctxt "RGN3_142"
msgid "All right, all right, goddammit."
msgstr "Гаразд, гаразд, чорт забирай."

#. Key: RGN3_144
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 不様ね……。
msgctxt "RGN3_144"
msgid "Pathetic..."
msgstr "Жалюгідно..."

#. Key: RGN4_002
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ふん。どこの支部も造りは似たり寄ったりだな。
#. JA:   この景色も見飽きたぜ。
msgctxt "RGN4_002"
msgid ""
"Hmph. All these branches look the same.\n"
"I feel like I've been here before."
msgstr "Хм. Усі ці відділення схожі одне на одне. Мені вже остогид цей краєвид."

#. Key: RGN4_003
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 何の感慨もなく俺は目的の階層に降りた。
#. JA:   もはや見慣れた、巨大な擂り鉢のような造りのフロアだ。
#. JA: 何の感慨もなく俺は目的の階層に降りた。
#. JA:   もはや見慣れた、巨大なすり鉢のような造りのフロアだ。
msgctxt "RGN4_003"
msgid ""
"I arrive on the floor I've been looking for.\n"
"'Course, all these places look the same."
msgstr ""
"Без жодних емоцій я спустився на потрібний рівень. Цей поверх, схожий\n"
"на велетенську ступу, вже став мені звичним."

#. Key: RGN4_004
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: その擂り鉢の底に「釜」がある。
#. JA: そのすり鉢の底に「窯」がある。
msgctxt "RGN4_004"
msgid "Somewhere under here is the Cauldron..."
msgstr "На дні цієї ступи розташований «Котел»."

#. Key: RGN4_005
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: さてと……ん？
msgctxt "RGN4_005"
msgid ""
"Now then...\n"
"Hm?"
msgstr "Ну що ж... Га?"

#. Key: RGN4_006
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺はふと気づいた。釜のそばに人影がある。
#. JA: 俺はふと気づいた。窯のそばに人影がある。
msgctxt "RGN4_006"
msgid "I feel a shiver run up my spine and whip around to see a silhouette."
msgstr "Раптом я помітив біля Котла чийсь силует."

#. Key: RGN4_007
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 白い仮面には目も鼻も口もない。
#. JA:   何だありゃと思った瞬間――――
#. JA: 白い仮面には目も鼻も口もない。
#. JA:   何だありゃと思った瞬間―――
msgctxt "RGN4_007"
msgid ""
"Its face is smooth and white. No mouth, no nose, nothing...\n"
"I open my mouth to yell, but nothing comes out."
msgstr ""
"На білій масці не було ні очей, ні носа, ні рота. Щойно я подумав, що це\n"
"за чортівня..."

#. Key: RGN4_008
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺の背筋は、凍り付いた。
msgctxt "RGN4_008"
msgid "I...I can't move..."
msgstr "По спині пробіг холодний піт."

#. Key: RGN4_011
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: みしり、と俺の右腕が――――が軋みを上げた。
#. JA:   体の奥底からよくわからない感情が湧きあがってくる。
#. JA: みしり、と俺の右腕―――が軋みを上げた。
#. JA:   体の奥底からよくわからない感情が湧きあがってくる。
msgctxt "RGN4_011"
msgid ""
"I can't move my right hand...\n"
"I feel something weird...some odd feeling, like someone's squeezing my chest."
msgstr ""
"Моя права рука з хрускотом напружилася. Із глибини тіла підіймалося\n"
"якесь незрозуміле відчуття."

#. Key: RGN4_012
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: それが恐怖だと気がつくまで数秒かかった。
#. JA:   脂汗がにじみだす。
msgctxt "RGN4_012"
msgid ""
"It's a few moments before I realize what it is...\n"
"...Fear.\n"
"My palms start to sweat."
msgstr ""
"Лише за кілька секунд я зрозумів, що це страх. Мене кинуло в холодний\n"
"піт."

#. Key: RGN4_013
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 何をびびってやがる、あんな奴――――
#. JA: （何をビビってやがる、あんな奴―――）
msgctxt "RGN4_013"
msgid "What's with that guy?"
msgstr "(Чого це я злякався цього типа...?)"

#. Key: RGN4_014
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺は改めて白い奴に目を向けた。
#. JA:   途端、ぐらりと視界が歪んだ。
msgctxt "RGN4_014"
msgid "I look at the masked man again, and my vision goes all...weird."
msgstr "Я знову глянув на білого типа — і перед очима все попливло."

#. Key: RGN4_015
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なんだ……この感覚は……？
msgctxt "RGN4_015"
msgid "What's this feeling...?"
msgstr "Що... це за відчуття...?"

#. Key: RGN4_016
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 言い表すなら、強烈な既視感。
#. JA:   そして異常なまでの恐怖。
#. JA:   俺の中の根源的な何かが、奴に怯えている。
msgctxt "RGN4_016"
msgid ""
"It's...almost like deja vu, but...weirder...\n"
"And the fear of the guy just won't go away...\n"
"Why the hell am I so scared of him?"
msgstr ""
"Якщо спробувати описати — надзвичайно сильне дежавю. І неприродно\n"
"сильний страх. Щось первісне в мені боїться його."

#. Key: RGN4_017
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 蒼の魔道書か……？
#. JA:   クソッ、テメェは黙ってろ！
#. JA: 「蒼」の魔道書か……？
#. JA:   クソッ、テメェは黙ってろ！
msgctxt "RGN4_017"
msgid ""
"The Azure Grimoire...?\n"
"Dammit, shut up!"
msgstr "«Лазурний» гримуар...? Чорт, а ти заткнися!"

#. Key: RGN4_018
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 久しいな「黒き者」よ。
msgctxt "RGN4_018"
msgid "Much time has passed since we last met, Black Beast."
msgstr "Давно не бачилися, Чорний."

#. Key: RGN4_019
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 久しい……？
#. JA:   何言ってんだ……テメェ。
#. JA:   俺ァ、しらねぇぞ……テメェなんか。
#. JA: 久しい……？　何言ってんだ……テメェ。
#. JA:   俺ァ、しらねぇぞ……テメェなんか。
msgctxt "RGN4_019"
msgid ""
"Time has passed? What the hell are you talking about?\n"
"I've never seen you before."
msgstr "Давно...? Про що ти, в біса, говориш? Я тебе зроду не бачив."

#. Key: RGN4_020
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どうした？
#. JA:   声が震えているぞ、何をそんなに怯えている？
msgctxt "RGN4_020"
msgid "Is something amiss? Your voice trembles. What are you afraid of?"
msgstr "Що таке? Голос у тебе тремтить. Чого ти так боїшся?"

#. Key: RGN4_021
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うるせぇ、黙ってろ……。
msgctxt "RGN4_021"
msgid "Shut the hell up...!"
msgstr "Заткнися...!"

#. Key: RGN4_022
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: （ヤベェ、声聞くだけでブルッちまってる。
#. JA:   クソッ、何だってーんだ一体……）
#. JA: （ヤベェ、声聞くだけでブルッちまってる。
#. JA:   　クソッ、何だってーんだ一体……）
msgctxt "RGN4_022"
msgid "(Crap...my body's trembling just hearing his voice. Who the hell is this guy...?)"
msgstr ""
"(Паскудство, мене тіпає вже від самого його голосу. Що це, в біса,\n"
"таке...?)"

#. Key: RGN4_023
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……逃げぬだけ褒めてやろう。
#. JA:   来い。早めに終らせてやる。
msgctxt "RGN4_023"
msgid ""
"...You have stood your ground, and for that you have earned my respect.\n"
"Come... I shall end this."
msgstr "...Похвалю хоча б за те, що не втік. Підходь. Я швидко з тобою покінчу."

#. Key: RGN4_024
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なんだテメェ、偉そうに！
#. JA:   誰が終わりだ、このお面野郎が！
msgctxt "RGN4_024"
msgid "Who the hell do you think you are!? You're not ending anything!"
msgstr "Чого це ти так зверхньо?! Хто тут із ким покінчить, виродку в масці?!"

#. Key: RGN4_025
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 貴様……。
#. JA:   まあいい、どんな形であれ、貴様は滅するのみ。
msgctxt "RGN4_025"
msgid "Fool... I shall see you expunged from this world, no matter the cost."
msgstr "Ти... Хай там як, на тебе чекає лише смерть."

#. Key: RGN4_026
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃――――
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての罪を刈り取り悪を滅する！
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃―――
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての罪を刈り取り悪を滅する！
msgctxt "RGN4_026"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just sword.\n"
"With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this world, and cleanse it in the fires of\n"
"destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Я єдиним мечем пожну всі гріхи\n"
"та знищу зло!"

#. Key: RGN4_027
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 我が名はハクメン、推して参る！！！
msgctxt "RGN4_027"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come."
msgstr "Імʼя мені Хакумен. До бою!!!"

#. Key: RGN4_031
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ぐはっ…！　く、クソが！
#. JA: ぐはっ……！　く、クソが！
msgctxt "RGN4_031"
msgid "Gah! S-Sonuvabitch!"
msgstr "Ґах...! От же ж сучий син!"

#. Key: RGN4_032
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どうした、貴様は世界最強では無いのか？
#. JA:   ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ。
#. JA: どうした、貴様は世界最強では無いのか？
#. JA:   ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ！
msgctxt "RGN4_032"
msgid ""
"What is this foolishness? Is this the most I can expect from Ragna the Bloodedge, the\n"
"most notorious criminal to walk the earth?"
msgstr "Що таке? Хіба ти не найсильніший у світі, Раґно Бладедж?"

#. Key: RGN4_033
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うるせぇ……！
#. JA:   クソッ、傷が直らねぇ、どうなってやがる……。
#. JA: うるせぇ……！
#. JA:   クソッ、傷が治らねぇ、どうなってやがる……。
msgctxt "RGN4_033"
msgid ""
"Shut up...!\n"
"Dammit, my wounds aren't healing...\n"
"What the hell's goin' on...!?"
msgstr "Заткнися...! Чорт, рани не гояться. Що тут, у біса, коїться...?"

#. Key: RGN4_034
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 我が刃の前では貴様の力など無意味。
#. JA:   凶に繋がりし縁、今ここで断ち切ってくれよう。
#. JA: 我が刃の前では貴様の力など無意味。
#. JA:   凶<ruby>マガト</ruby>に繋がりし縁<ruby>えにし</ruby>、今ここで断ち切ってくれよう。
msgctxt "RGN4_034"
msgid ""
"Whatever power you may possess, it will wither and die before my blade.\n"
"This is your fate, Bloodedge, and you would do well to accept it."
msgstr ""
"Перед моїм лезом твоя сила нічого не варта. Нині я розітну зв’язок, що\n"
"поєднує тебе з лихом."

#. Key: RGN4_035
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……ここまで…か……。
#. JA: ……ここまで……か……。
msgctxt "RGN4_035"
msgid "Is— Is this...it...?"
msgstr "...Це... кінець...?"

#. Key: RGN4_039
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ヤベェ！　つえぇぞ、こいつ！
#. JA: （ヤベェ！　つえぇぞ、こいつ！）
msgctxt "RGN4_039"
msgid "Dammit! This guy's tough!"
msgstr "(Паскудство! Оце він сильний!)"

#. Key: RGN4_040
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どうした？　ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ！
msgctxt "RGN4_040"
msgid "Have you grown weary of our fight so quickly, Ragna the Bloodedge?"
msgstr "Що таке, Раґно Бладедж?!"

#. Key: RGN4_042
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna & Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN4_042"
msgid "!?"
msgstr "!?"

#. Key: RGN4_043
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN4_043"
msgid "!?"
msgstr "!?"

#. Key: RGN4_044
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: チィッ！！
#. JA:   クッ、事象干渉か！
#. JA:   邪魔をするな、化け猫め！！
msgctxt "RGN4_044"
msgid "Guh! How dare you interrupt me, Grimalkin!"
msgstr ""
"Кх... Втручання в причинність!? Не ставай мені на заваді, клята\n"
"відьомська кицька!"

#. Key: RGN4_046
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: な……消えた……？　レイチェル？
#. JA:   じゃねーよな……。なにもんだったんだ一体……。
msgctxt "RGN4_046"
msgid ""
"Wha... He disappeared...? Rachel? No, it couldn't be...\n"
"Who the hell was that...?"
msgstr "Що... зник...? Рейчел? Ні, це була не вона... Що це взагалі було...?"

#. Key: RGN4_047
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: クッ……。
msgctxt "RGN4_047"
msgid "Guh..."
msgstr "Кх..."

#. Key: RGN4_048
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: （まだ、膝が笑ってやがる。このまま戦ってたら、危なかったぜ）
msgctxt "RGN4_048"
msgid ""
"(Heh...my knees are about to give. Good thing that fight didn't last too much\n"
"longer.)"
msgstr ""
"(Коліна досі тремтять. Якби ми продовжили битися, мені було б\n"
"непереливки.)"

#. Key: RGN4_050
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ちっ。間に合わなかったか。
#. JA:   ……蓋が、開いちまう。
msgctxt "RGN4_050"
msgid ""
"Tch... A little too late, huh?\n"
"...The Cauldron is about to awaken."
msgstr "Ць. Не встиг. ...Кришка котла відкривається."

#. Key: RGN4_054
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そこの男、待てっぇぇえええい！！
msgctxt "RGN4_054"
msgid "You there! Haaalt!"
msgstr "Гей, ти! Сто-о-о-яти-и-и-и!!"

#. Key: RGN4_055
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 唐突にバカでかい声が響いた。
#. JA:   まさか。また俺なのか？
#. JA: 唐突に背後からバカでかい声を受けて、俺は足を止めた。
msgctxt "RGN4_055"
msgid ""
"I hear some jackass yelling behind me. I stop for a moment, thinking he might be\n"
"talking to me..."
msgstr ""
"Раптом позаду пролунав оглушливий голос, і я зупинився. Невже знову\n"
"до мене?"

#. Key: RGN4_056
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺じゃ無いな、と……。
#. JA: 俺じゃないな、と……。
msgctxt "RGN4_056"
msgid "Must be for someone else..."
msgstr "Та ні, не до мене..."

#. Key: RGN4_057
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺は今までよりも早足で、再び歩き始めた。
#. JA: 俺は今までよりもさらに早足で、再び歩き始めた。
msgctxt "RGN4_057"
msgid "I start walking again. Faster."
msgstr "Я знову рушив, тільки тепер іще швидше."

#. Key: RGN4_058
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 待てと言うておるに！！
#. JA:   とおっ！！
msgctxt "RGN4_058"
msgid ""
"I said wait!\n"
"Toh!"
msgstr "Я сказав стояти! То-о!"

#. Key: RGN4_059
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……何だってんだよ、アンタ。
msgctxt "RGN4_059"
msgid "...Who the heck are you?"
msgstr "...Хто ти чорт забирай такий?"

#. Key: RGN4_060
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 聞かれて名乗るもおこがましいが、　
#. JA:   それほどまでに知りたいのならば
#. JA:   教えてやってもいいでござる！
msgctxt "RGN4_060"
msgid ""
"It's not my policy to reveal my name just because I was asked, but if you really want\n"
"to know that much, I think I can make an exception!"
msgstr ""
"Називатися лише тому, що мене спитали не в мому стилі, але якщо тобі\n"
"так кортить — можу й сказати!"

#. Key: RGN4_061
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 拙者はシシガミ＝バング！！
#. JA:   愛と正義の快男児でござ―――――るっ！！
msgctxt "RGN4_061"
msgid ""
"I am none other than Bang Shishigami!\n"
"I am the man who fights in the name of love and justice!"
msgstr "Я — Шішіґамі Банґ!! Славний муж любові та справедливості-і-і!!"

#. Key: RGN4_062
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN4_062"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RGN4_063
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そうか。それはよかったな。
#. JA:   じゃあな、オッサン。
msgctxt "RGN4_063"
msgid ""
"I see, I see... That's wonderful.\n"
"See ya around, old man."
msgstr "Ясно. Ну й чудово. Бувай, дядьку."

#. Key: RGN4_064
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: だから待てと言うておるでござる！
#. JA:   それに今、聞き捨てならん呼び方をしたでござるな！！
msgctxt "RGN4_064"
msgid "I told you to wait! Besides, you just called me something veeeery rude!"
msgstr ""
"Я ж сказав стояти! І щойно ти назвав мене так, що я не можу це\n"
"пропустити повз вуха!!"

#. Key: RGN4_065
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ったく。うっとうしいにもほどがあるな。
#. JA:   その愛と正義の怪男児さんとやらが、
#. JA:   俺に何の用なんだよ？
#. JA: ったく。うっとうしいにもほどがあるな。
#. JA:   その愛と正義の怪男児さんとやらが、俺に何の用なんだよ？
msgctxt "RGN4_065"
msgid ""
"Geez, there should be a limit to how annoying someone can be.\n"
"And what does the man who fights in the name of 'love and justice' want with me?"
msgstr ""
"От же ж причепа. Усьому має бути межа. То чого цьому химерному мужу\n"
"любові та справедливості від мене треба?"

#. Key: RGN4_066
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 何の用だと？
#. JA:   白々しいわ、この前代未聞の大悪党め！
msgctxt "RGN4_066"
msgid "What do I want with you!? I thought you already knew...villain!"
msgstr "Чого мені треба?! Не прикидайся дурнем, нечуваний лиходію!"

#. Key: RGN4_067
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 神妙にお縄につけい！
#. JA:   そして拙者の家計と経験値の足しとなるがいい！！
msgctxt "RGN4_067"
msgid "Accept your defeat! You shall become a stepping stone to pave my path to glory!"
msgstr ""
"Смиренно дай себе зв’язати! І поповни мій сімейний бюджет та зроби\n"
"мене відомим!!"

#. Key: RGN4_068
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: やべぇ、頭痛くなってきた。
msgctxt "RGN4_068"
msgid "I'm starting to get a headache."
msgstr "Ой, голова вже болить."

#. Key: RGN4_069
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 愛と正義の頼れる忍者、シシガミ＝バング！
#. JA:   ここに見参！！　ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ！！
#. JA:   いざ、尋常に勝負でござ～る！！！！
msgctxt "RGN4_069"
msgid ""
"The magnificent ninja of love and justice, Bang Shishigami!\n"
"Here I come, Ragna the Bloodedge! Now, surrender!"
msgstr ""
"Надійний нінджя любові та справедливості, Шішіґамі Банґ, прибув!!\n"
"Раґно Бладедж! Стань до чесного двобою-ю-ю!!!!"

#. Key: RGN4_073
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ぬ、ぬかったわ……！
#. JA:   このシシガミ＝バングともあろう者が……。
#. JA:   む、無念……がくり。
msgctxt "RGN4_073"
msgid ""
"H-How could this...!\n"
"For the great Bang Shishigami to be defeated so easily... Impossible..."
msgstr "Я-яка необачність...! Щоб сам Шішіґамі Банґ... Яка ганьба... *падає*"

#. Key: RGN4_074
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN4_074"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RGN4_075
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: さてと、行くか。
#. JA:   ん～今日の夕飯なんにしようかな。
msgctxt "RGN4_075"
msgid ""
"All right, I guess I'll be going.\n"
"What should I get for dinner...?"
msgstr "Ну що ж, час іти. Цікаво, що сьогодні буде на вечерю?"

#. Key: RGN4_076
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺は何事もなかったかのように（自分に言い聞かせて）
#. JA:   口笛を吹きながらその場を後にした。
#. JA: 俺は何事もなかったかのように自分に言い聞かせ、
#. JA:   口笛を吹きながらその場を後にした。
msgctxt "RGN4_076"
msgid ""
"I think it's best if I just pretend nothing happened...\n"
"I shake his blood off my sword and walk away, whistling."
msgstr "Я переконав себе, що нічого не сталося, і пішов геть, насвистуючи."

#. Key: RGN4_079
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: こ、こんなむさ苦しい奴に……。
#. JA:   俺が負ける……だと……？
msgctxt "RGN4_079"
msgid "I...I can't believe...I lost to some weirdo..."
msgstr "Щ-щоб я... програв такому диваку...?"

#. Key: RGN4_080
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 前代未聞の大罪人、
#. JA:   ラグナ…以下略を召し捕ったりぃぃぃい！！
#. JA: 前代未聞の大罪人、
#. JA:   ラグナ……以下略を召し捕ったりぃぃぃい！！
msgctxt "RGN4_080"
msgid "And thus, the greatest villain falls by the hands of Bang Shishigami!"
msgstr "Нечуваного злочинця Раґну... було схо-о-оплено і все таке!!"

#. Key: RGN4_081
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: これで我が夢イカルガ復興も
#. JA:   大きく一歩前進じゃ――――ーい！！
#. JA: これで我が夢イカルガ復興も
#. JA:   大きく一歩前進じゃ―――い！！
msgctxt "RGN4_081"
msgid "Now...I am one step closer to my dream of reviving Ikaruga!"
msgstr ""
"Тепер моя мрія відродити Ікаруґу стала ще на великий крок\n"
"ближчою-ю-ю!!"

#. Key: RGN4_082
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: やーはーり、このバングこそがカグツチ最強の、否！
#. JA:   世界最強の咎追いなり――――――――ー！
#. JA:   はーっはっはっはっはっ……！
#. JA: やーはーり、このバングこそがカグツチ最強の、否！
#. JA:   世界最強の咎追いなり―――――――！
#. JA:   はーっはっはっはっはっ……！
msgctxt "RGN4_082"
msgid ""
"As I thought! I am the strongest in Kagutsu— No...strongest in the world!\n"
"Haaaahahahahahah!"
msgstr ""
"Так і є! Я, Банґ, найсильніший мисливець за головами в Каґуцучі — ні, у\n"
"світі! Га-а-а-ха-ха-ха-ха...!"

#. Key: RGN4_083
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: やべぇ……涙出てきた……。
msgctxt "RGN4_083"
msgid "No...I think I'm gonna cry..."
msgstr "Ой... зараз заплачу..."

#. Key: RGN5_001
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: System
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN5_001"
msgid "CAUTION!　CAUTION!　CAUTION!"
msgstr "УВАГА!　УВАГА!　УВАГА!"

#. Key: RGN5_002
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: System
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN5_002"
msgid ""
"UNIT MURAKUMO No. 13\n"
"REPRODUCTION PROGRAM SCHEDULE ENDED"
msgstr "МОДУЛЬ МУРАКУМО №13 ПРОГРАМУ ВІДТВОРЕННЯ ЗАВЕРШЕНО"

#. Key: RGN5_003
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: System
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN5_003"
msgid "THE ν START-UP READY"
msgstr "НЮ ГОТОВА ДО ЗАПУСКУ"

#. Key: RGN5_004
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 精錬が終わっちまったか。
#. JA:   ……めんどくせえな。
msgctxt "RGN5_004"
msgid ""
"Done booting already?\n"
"What a pain in the ass..."
msgstr "Виплавлення вже завершилося? ...От морока."

#. Key: RGN5_005
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 面倒くさいなんてものじゃない。
#. JA:   もっと、こう……気分が悪いものだ。
msgctxt "RGN5_005"
msgid ""
"This isn't good...\n"
"I'm startin' to feel like I'm gonna hurl just thinking about it..."
msgstr "Це вже не просто морока. Від цього якось... аж верне."

#. Key: RGN5_006
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 唇を少し噛み締める。
#. JA:   やがて、窯から生まれたそれは上からゆっくりと降りてきた。
#. JA: 唇を少し噛み締める。
#. JA:   やがて窯から生まれたそれは、ゆっくりと目の前へ降りてきた。
msgctxt "RGN5_006"
msgid "I grit my teeth. That...thing is getting closer..."
msgstr ""
"Я злегка закусив губу. Невдовзі породжене Котлом створіння повільно\n"
"спустилося переді мною."

#. Key: RGN5_007
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
