#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……ちっ。
msgctxt "RGN5_013"
msgid "...Tch."
msgstr "...Ць."

#. Key: RGN5_014
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ふぅ……。あ、ごめんね。
#. JA:   でも久しぶりだね、えっとぉ…三回目だっけ？
#. JA: ふぅ……。あ、ごめんね。
#. JA:   でも久しぶりだね、えっとぉ……三回目だっけ？
msgctxt "RGN5_014"
msgid ""
"*sigh*... Ah, sorry about that.\n"
"But it really has been a while. Um... Third time, right?"
msgstr "Фух... Ой, вибач. Давненько не бачилися. Е-е... це втретє, так?"

#. Key: RGN5_015
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 三回目だ馬鹿……。ん？　合ってる？
msgctxt "RGN5_015"
msgid ""
"Third time, stupid...\n"
"Wait— Is that right?"
msgstr "Утретє, дурепо... Га? Справді?"

#. Key: RGN5_016
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: （なんだこの違和感は……。）
msgctxt "RGN5_016"
msgid "(What is this strange feeling...?)"
msgstr "(Що це за дивне відчуття...?)"

#. Key: RGN5_017
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ふふふ……。いらっしゃい。
#. JA:   ……またニューのこと、殺しに来たの？
msgctxt "RGN5_017"
msgid ""
"*giggle*... Welcome.\n"
"...Did you come to kill me again?"
msgstr "Хи-хи-хи... Ласкаво прошу. ...Знову прийшов убити Ню?"

#. Key: RGN5_018
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 殺しにじゃねぇよ。
#. JA:   壊しに、だ。
msgctxt "RGN5_018"
msgid "I didn't come to kill you. I came to <DQ>destroy<DQ> you."
msgstr "Не вбити. Знищити."

#. Key: RGN5_019
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: どっちでも同じことだよ。
#. JA:   この前なんて、すごく痛かったんだから！
#. JA:   いきなり斬られて死ぬかと思っちゃった。
#. JA: どっちでも同じことだよ。
#. JA:   この前なんて、すっごく痛かったんだから！
#. JA:   いきなり斬られて死ぬかと思っちゃった。
msgctxt "RGN5_019"
msgid ""
"Those are one and the same. You know it hurt so much last time...!\n"
"When you lashed out at me, I thought I was a goner!"
msgstr ""
"Яка різниця? Минулого разу було так боляче! Ти раптом мене розрубав\n"
"— я думала, що помру."

#. Key: RGN5_020
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 黙れ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_020"
msgid "Shut up..."
msgstr "Замовкни..."

#. Key: RGN5_021
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: でもさ、ラグナ……。
#. JA:   気持ち良かったでしょう……？
msgctxt "RGN5_021"
msgid "But, Ragna... Didn't it feel wonderful...?"
msgstr "Але ж, Раґно... тобі було приємно, правда...?"

#. Key: RGN5_022
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN5_022"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RGN5_023
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ニューの体を斬ったり、刺したりして……。
#. JA:   あの時、無抵抗だったニューをあれ程苛めてさ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_023"
msgid "You slashed me...pierced me all over...when I was completely defenseless..."
msgstr "Ти різав і колов тіло Ню... Так знущався з беззахисної Ню..."

#. Key: RGN5_024
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 黙れ！！！
msgctxt "RGN5_024"
msgid "Shut up!"
msgstr "Замовкни!!!"

#. Key: RGN5_025
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: だってあの時のラグナ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_025"
msgid "You knew what you were doing that time."
msgstr "Бо тоді ти, Раґно..."

#. Key: RGN5_026
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 黙れって言ってんだよ！！！
msgctxt "RGN5_026"
msgid "I told you to shut up!"
msgstr "Я сказав замовкнути!!!"

#. Key: RGN5_027
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 笑ってたよ……？
#. JA: 笑ってたよ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_027"
msgid "You were smiling..."
msgstr "Ти усміхався..."

#. Key: RGN5_028
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: グッ……！
msgctxt "RGN5_028"
msgid "Ugh...!"
msgstr "Кх...!"

#. Key: RGN5_029
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: でも今日は違うよ、
#. JA:   ほらちゃんとした体ができて、お話できるよ。
msgctxt "RGN5_029"
msgid "But today's gonna be different. See? I even have a new body, and I can talk."
msgstr ""
"Але сьогодні все інакше. Дивись: тепер у мене справжнє тіло й ми\n"
"можемо поговорити."

#. Key: RGN5_030
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あー！
#. JA:   でもラグナはこの前みたいな方がいいのかな？
msgctxt "RGN5_030"
msgid ""
"Ah!\n"
"But, would you prefer something like last time?"
msgstr "А-а! Чи, може, тобі більше сподобалося минулого разу?"

#. Key: RGN5_031
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: テメェは！　黙れって言ってんだよ！！
#. JA:   その顔で、その声で、胸くそ悪い台詞を吐くんじゃねえ！！
#. JA: テメェは！　黙れって言ってんだよ！！
#. JA:   その顔で、その声で、胸クソ悪い台詞を吐くんじゃねえ！！
msgctxt "RGN5_031"
msgid "I said shut up! That face! That voice! Don't you dare talk to me like that!"
msgstr ""
"Я сказав замовкнути!! Не смій цим обличчям, цим голосом казати таку\n"
"гидоту!!"

#. Key: RGN5_032
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN5_032"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RGN5_033
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺はテメェを壊しに来た！　それだけだ！！
#. JA:   話すことなんぞ、何もねえんだよ！！
msgctxt "RGN5_033"
msgid ""
"I'm here to destroy you! That's all there is to it! There's nothing we need to talk\n"
"about!"
msgstr "Я прийшов тебе знищити! І все!! Нам нема про що говорити!!"

#. Key: RGN5_034
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……ふふ……ふふふふ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_034"
msgid "*giggle*"
msgstr "...Хи-хи... хи-хи-хи-хи..."

#. Key: RGN5_035
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なんだよ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_035"
msgid "What...!?"
msgstr "Чого ти...?"

#. Key: RGN5_036
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ははははは！
#. JA:   やっぱりラグナもニューと同じだね、うん同じだよ。
#. JA:   はははははははは！
#. JA: ははははは！
#. JA:   やっぱりラグナもニューと同じだね！　うん、同じだよ！
#. JA:   はははははははは！
msgctxt "RGN5_036"
msgid ""
"Hahahaha!\n"
"I knew you were just like me... Yeah... Just like me.\n"
"Hahaha!"
msgstr ""
"Ха-ха-ха-ха! Я так і знала: Раґна такий самий, як Ню! Так, однакові!\n"
"Ха-ха-ха-ха-ха-ха-ха-ха!"

#. Key: RGN5_037
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 何言ってやがる！
msgctxt "RGN5_037"
msgid "What the hell are you talking about!?"
msgstr "Що ти верзеш?!"

#. Key: RGN5_038
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ラグナは壊したいんだよね？
#. JA:   ニューも自分も世界も……。
#. JA:   グチャグチャにグチャグチャに壊したいんだよね。
msgctxt "RGN5_038"
msgid ""
"Ragna, you want to destroy things, right? Me... Yourself... This whole world...!\n"
"You want to destroy it all!"
msgstr "Ти ж хочеш усе знищити, Раґно? Ню, себе, увесь світ... Розтрощити все."

#. Key: RGN5_039
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そうだよね、ラグナには力がある。
#. JA:   「蒼」の魔道書。世界と戦える力……。
#. JA:   力があるんだもん、使いたいよね、ラグナ。
msgctxt "RGN5_039"
msgid ""
"Of course... Because you have the power to do that.\n"
"The Azure Grimoire... The power to fight against all of humanity...\n"
"You already have the power, so of course, you want to use it."
msgstr ""
"Авжеж, у Раґни є сила. «Лазурний» гримуар. Сила, здатна битися з усім\n"
"світом... Маєш силу — отже, хочеш нею скористатися, правда, Раґно?"

#. Key: RGN5_040
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ウッ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_040"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Кх..."

#. Key: RGN5_041
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: いいよ、殺し合おうラグナ。
#. JA:   何時までも何時までも何時までも……ふふっ。
#. JA:   ニューはね、ラグナの望む事だったら何でもしてあげる。
#. JA: いいよ、殺<ruby>や</ruby>り合おうラグナ。
#. JA:   何時までも何時までも何時までも……ふふっ。
#. JA:   ニューはね、ラグナの望む事だったら何でもしてあげる。
msgctxt "RGN5_041"
msgid ""
"That's OK, Ragna... We can go at it...until the end of time... *giggle*\n"
"You know I'd do anything for you, Ragna."
msgstr ""
"Добре, повбиваймо одне одного, Раґно. Вічно, вічно, вічно... хи-хи. Ню\n"
"зробить усе, чого забажає Раґна."

#. Key: RGN5_042
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: だってニューはラグナのモノだもん。
#. JA:   ラグナを満たせるのはニューだけ。
#. JA:   そう、ニューだけだよ。
msgctxt "RGN5_042"
msgid ""
"Because I'm yours, Ragna.\n"
"I'm the only one who can satisfy you, Ragna...\n"
"Yeah... I'm the only one."
msgstr ""
"Бо Ню належить Раґні. Лише Ню може вдовольнити Раґну. Так, лише\n"
"Ню."

#. Key: RGN5_043
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: テメェ……！
msgctxt "RGN5_043"
msgid "Bitch...!"
msgstr "Скотина...!"

#. Key: RGN5_044
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おいでラグナ……抱きしめてあげる。
msgctxt "RGN5_044"
msgid "Come, Ragna... Let me put my arms around you."
msgstr "Іди до мене, Раґно... Я тебе обійму."

#. Key: RGN5_053
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: はぁはぁはぁ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_053"
msgid "*pant* *pant* *pant*"
msgstr "Ха-а... ха-а... ха-а..."

#. Key: RGN5_054
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ふふっふふふ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_054"
msgid "*giggle*"
msgstr "Хи-хи... хи-хи-хи..."

#. Key: RGN5_055
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なんだよ！　なんなんだよこれ！
#. JA:   ワケわかんねーぞ！！！
msgctxt "RGN5_055"
msgid ""
"What...What the hell is this!?\n"
"What the hell is goin' on!?"
msgstr "Що це?! Що це все таке?! Нічого не розумію!!!"

#. Key: RGN5_056
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: はははは！！！
msgctxt "RGN5_056"
msgid "Haa ha ha ha!"
msgstr "Ха-ха-ха-ха!!!"

#. Key: RGN5_057
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 誰なんだテメェは！！
msgctxt "RGN5_057"
msgid "Who the hell are you!?"
msgstr "Хто ти, в біса, така?!"

#. Key: RGN5_058
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: まだ分からないのラグナ……？
#. JA:   そう、そんなに認めたく無いんだ……
#. JA:   自分を。自分自身を。
#. JA: まだ分からないのラグナ……？
#. JA:   そう、そんなに認めたくないんだ……。
#. JA:   自分を。自分自身を。
msgctxt "RGN5_058"
msgid ""
"You still don't get it, Ragna...?\n"
"I see... You're just in denial... You don't want to admit it."
msgstr ""
"Ти досі не розумієш, Раґно...? Ясно, ти настільки не хочеш цього\n"
"визнавати... Перед самим собою. Перед тим, ким ти є насправді."

#. Key: RGN5_059
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なに言ってだよテメェは！
#. JA: なにいってんだよテメェは！
msgctxt "RGN5_059"
msgid "What are you saying!?"
msgstr "Що ти верзеш?!"

#. Key: RGN5_060
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: じゃあ、認めさせてあげる、ニューがラグナが……。
#. JA:   何なのか……。
msgctxt "RGN5_060"
msgid "Then, I'll open your eyes... I'll show you what I am to you..."
msgstr "Тоді Ню змусить тебе визнати... ким насправді є Ню та Раґна..."

#. Key: RGN5_062
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN5_062"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RGN5_063
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ！？
#. JA:   何で……俺が……いやがる……。
#. JA: !?
#. JA:   何で……俺が……いやがる……。
msgctxt "RGN5_063"
msgid ""
"!?\n"
"What the hell...am I doing...?"
msgstr "!? Чому... що...?"

#. Key: RGN5_064
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 自分の眼でしっかり確かめて……。
#. JA:   私達がなんのために造られたのか……。
msgctxt "RGN5_064"
msgid ""
"Take a good look with your own eyes...\n"
"At the real reason why we were created...!"
msgstr "Поглянь уважно на власні очі... Заради чого нас створили..."

#. Key: RGN5_068
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
