#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: グハッ！！
msgctxt "RGN5_069"
msgid "Argh! "
msgstr "Ґах!!"

#. Key: RGN5_070
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ごめんねラグナ、
#. JA:   今回はニューがラグナの事、苛めちゃってるね。
msgctxt "RGN5_070"
msgid "I'm sorry, Ragna, but it's my turn now."
msgstr "Вибач, Раґно. Цього разу черга Ню."

#. Key: RGN5_071
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: でも、気持良いよラグナ、凄く気持ち良いい……。
#. JA:   じゃあこの大きいのも行くね。
#. JA: でも、気持良いよラグナ、すごく気持ち良い……。
#. JA:   じゃあこの大きいのも行くね。
msgctxt "RGN5_071"
msgid ""
"But, it feels good, Ragna... Very, very good...\n"
"This big one's my favorite...!"
msgstr ""
"Але ж приємно, Раґно? Дуже-дуже приємно... Тоді ось тобі ще й ця\n"
"велика."

#. Key: RGN5_072
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: グシャ！
msgctxt "RGN5_072"
msgid "*Crunch*"
msgstr "*Хрусь!*"

#. Key: RGN5_073
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ガァッ！！
msgctxt "RGN5_073"
msgid "Gargh!"
msgstr "Ґа-а!!"

#. Key: RGN5_074
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……テメェ……遊んでんじゃ……ねぇぞ。
#. JA:   このカス野郎……！
msgctxt "RGN5_074"
msgid ""
"You bitch...stop messing...with me...\n"
"You piece of shit...!"
msgstr "Ти... не грайся... зі мною. Мерзото...!"

#. Key: RGN5_075
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ん～ラグナは気持良くないみたいだね……。
#. JA:   じゃあ……もっともっと気持ち良くしてあげる……。
#. JA: ん～。ラグナは気持良くないみたいだね……。
#. JA:   じゃあ……もっともっと気持ち良くしてあげる……。
msgctxt "RGN5_075"
msgid ""
"Hmm... Ragna, you're not enjoying this...?\n"
"Then... I'll make you feel a lot better..."
msgstr ""
"М-м... Схоже, Раґні не дуже приємно... Тоді... Ню зробить тобі ще\n"
"набагато приємніше..."

#. Key: RGN5_076
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 第６６６拘束機関解放、次元干渉虚数法陣展開……
#. JA:   ムラクモユニット起動……
#. JA: 第666拘束機関解放、次元干渉虚数法陣展開……
#. JA:   ムラクモユニット起動……
msgctxt "RGN5_076"
msgid ""
"Restriction #666, released.\n"
"Dimensional interference field deployed...\n"
"Murakumo Unit, activated."
msgstr ""
"Обмежувальний механізм №666 знято. Розгортання уявної формації\n"
"просторового втручання... Модуль Муракумо запущено..."

#. Key: RGN5_077
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ッテ、テメェ……！
#. JA:   クソッ！
msgctxt "RGN5_077"
msgid ""
"Damn you...!\n"
"Ahhh... Shit!"
msgstr "Т-ти...! Чорт!"

#. Key: RGN5_078
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 第６６６拘束機関解放、次元干渉虚数法陣展開……
#. JA:   ブレイブルー……グハッ！
#. JA: 第666拘束機関解放、次元干渉虚数法陣展開……
#. JA:   「蒼<ruby>ブ</ruby>の<ruby>レ</ruby>魔<ruby>イ</ruby>道<ruby>ブ</ruby>書<ruby>ルー</ruby>」……グハッ！
msgctxt "RGN5_078"
msgid ""
"Restriction #666 released...\n"
"Dimensional interference field deployed...\n"
"BlazBlue... Uargh!"
msgstr ""
"Обмежувальний механізм №666 знято. Розгортання уявної формації\n"
"просторового втручання... «Лазурний» гримуар... Ґах!"

#. Key: RGN5_079
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ははははは！
#. JA:   もう遅い、もう手遅れ、もう戻れないよラグナ！
#. JA:   ラグナとニューは一つになるの！
msgctxt "RGN5_079"
msgid ""
"Hahahaha!\n"
"It's too late... It's too late to return, Ragna!\n"
"You and I are becoming one!"
msgstr ""
"Ха-ха-ха-ха! Запізно, вже запізно, вороття немає, Раґно! Раґна і Ню\n"
"стануть одним цілим!"

#. Key: RGN5_080
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: はは……ははははは！
msgctxt "RGN5_080"
msgid "Haha... Hahahahaha!"
msgstr "Ха-ха... ха-ха-ха-ха-ха!"

#. Key: RGN5_084
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そうかい……いいぜ……分かったよ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_084"
msgid "I see... Very well...I got it..."
msgstr "Он як... Гаразд... Я зрозумів..."

#. Key: RGN5_085
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: やってやるよ……
#. JA:   世界を……全てを壊してやるよ……。
#. JA: やってやるよ……。
#. JA:   世界を……全てを壊してやるよ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_085"
msgid ""
"So be it...!\n"
"I'll destroy it...everything...!"
msgstr "Я це зроблю... Знищу світ... Знищу все..."

#. Key: RGN5_092
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: くはっ――――く、クソが。
#. JA:   釜が目の前なんだ、テメェなんかに邪魔され――――
#. JA: くはっ―――く、クソが。
#. JA:   窯が目の前なんだ、テメェなんかに邪魔され―――
msgctxt "RGN5_092"
msgid ""
"Guargh... D-Damn you...!\n"
"The Cauldron is right in front of me...\n"
"I won't let you stop me now..."
msgstr ""
"Ґах... От же ж паскуда. Котел просто переді мною. Я не дам тобі\n"
"завадити..."

#. Key: RGN5_093
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 黒き者よ……。
#. JA:   境界の果てでまた会おう……。
msgctxt "RGN5_093"
msgid ""
"We shall meet again, Dark One...\n"
"...on the far side of the Boundary..."
msgstr "Чорний... Ми ще зустрінемося на краю Межі..."

#. Key: RGN5_094
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: さらばだ……。
msgctxt "RGN5_094"
msgid "Farewell..."
msgstr "Прощавай..."

#. Key: RGN5_098
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……どういうこった。
#. JA:   確かに今、俺はテメェを倒したはずだ。
msgctxt "RGN5_098"
msgid ""
"...What's going on?\n"
"I just beat you to a pulp...!"
msgstr "...Що це означає? Я ж щойно тебе здолав."

#. Key: RGN5_099
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 貴様では私に勝てない、永遠にな……。
msgctxt "RGN5_099"
msgid "You can never defeat me. It is a fool's errand to try."
msgstr "Тобі мене не перемогти. Ніколи..."

#. Key: RGN5_100
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: クソッどうなってやがるんだ！
#. JA: クソッ。どうなってやがるんだ！
msgctxt "RGN5_100"
msgid "What the hell's goin' on!?"
msgstr "Чорт! Що тут коїться?!"

