#. Key: RGN6_035
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: System
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: システムは正常に稼働中。
#. JA:   全データ「タカマガハラ」に転送。
#. JA:   システムは速やかに第７２５フェイズに移行。
#. JA: システムは正常に稼働中。
#. JA:   全データ「タカマガハラ」に転送。
#. JA:   システムは速やかに第725フェイズに移行。
msgctxt "RGN6_035"
msgid ""
"System operating within normal limits.\n"
"Transmitting all data to <DQ>Tamagahara<DQ>.\n"
"The system will now proceed to phase #725."
msgstr ""
"Система працює нормально. Передавання всіх даних до «Такамаґахари».\n"
"Система негайно переходить до фази №725."

#. Key: RGN6_039
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 必ず本物が勝つんだよ、この偽物が……なっ！？
#. JA: （必ず本物が勝つんだよ、この偽物が……なっ!?）
msgctxt "RGN6_039"
msgid ""
"The real one will always win, imposter...\n"
"!?"
msgstr "Справжній завжди перемагає, підробко... !?"

#. Key: RGN6_040
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なんだこりゃ……何でおれが……倒れてるんだ？
#. JA: （なんだこりゃ……何でおれが……倒れてるんだ？）
msgctxt "RGN6_040"
msgid "The hell is this...? Why am I...?"
msgstr "Що це...? Чому я... лежу на землі?"

#. Key: RGN6_041
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: クッ……体が……いうこと……きかねぇぞ……。
#. JA: （くっ……カラダがいうこときかねぇぞ……）
msgctxt "RGN6_041"
msgid "Guh...my body...won't obey me..."
msgstr "Кх... тіло... не слухається..."

#. Key: RGN6_042
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そこにいるのは誰ですか！
msgctxt "RGN6_042"
msgid "Who goes there!?"
msgstr "Хто там?!"

#. Key: RGN6_043
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 対象を確認……同一体と認識・接触開始……
msgctxt "RGN6_043"
msgid "Target confirmed...analyzed... Now beginning fusion."
msgstr ""
"Ціль підтверджено... Ідентифіковано як тотожну сутність. Починаю\n"
"контакт..."

#. Key: RGN6_044
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 答えなさい！！
msgctxt "RGN6_044"
msgid "Answer me!"
msgstr "Відповідайте!!"

#. Key: RGN6_045
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ―なっ、なにいってんだ俺は！―
#. JA: （なっ、なにいってんだ俺は！）
msgctxt "RGN6_045"
msgid "Wh-What are you talkin' about? I'm—"
msgstr "(Щ-що це я кажу?!)"

#. Key: RGN6_046
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 私は統制機構のノエル＝ヴァーミリオン少尉です！
#. JA:   貴方を拘束します！！！
msgctxt "RGN6_046"
msgid ""
"I am Lieutenant Noel Vermillion of the Librarium!\n"
"I'm placing you under arrest!"
msgstr ""
"Я лейтенантка Організації Контролю Ноель Верміліон! Ви\n"
"заарештовані!!!"

#. Key: RGN6_047
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 対象を障害と認識変更
#. JA:   速やかな排除を執り行う
msgctxt "RGN6_047"
msgid ""
"Target determined hostile.\n"
"Now commencing termination process."
msgstr "Ціль перекласифіковано як перешкоду. Негайно починаю усунення."

#. Key: RGN6_048
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ―おい、馬鹿、早く逃げろ！
#. JA: （……おい、馬鹿、早く逃げろ！）
msgctxt "RGN6_048"
msgid "...Hey, idiot...Run away!"
msgstr "(Тікай, дурепо!)"

#. Key: RGN6_049
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: って……あの女、おい待て似すぎだろ―
#. JA: （……あの女、おい待て似すぎだろ）
msgctxt "RGN6_049"
msgid ""
"...Wha—!? That girl...\n"
"Wait a minute, she looks way too similar—"
msgstr "(Ця дівчина... Вона аж надто схожа...)"

#. Key: RGN6_050
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 対象、事象兵器の所持を確認
#. JA:   驚異レベルを３から７まで引き上げる
msgctxt "RGN6_050"
msgid ""
"Target in possession of unknown weapons...\n"
"Increasing threat level from three to seven."
msgstr ""
"Підтверджено наявність у цілі Арк-Енемі. Підвищую рівень загрози з\n"
"третього до сьомого."

#. Key: RGN6_051
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ムラクモユニット起動、拘束機関開放、ブラッドサイズ展開
#. JA:   機能、対象の沈黙まで持続
#. JA: ムラクモユニット起動
#. JA:   拘束機関開放、ブラッドサイズ展開
#. JA:   機能、対象の沈黙まで持続……
msgctxt "RGN6_051"
msgid ""
"Murakumo unit activated... Blood-scythe deployed.\n"
"Functioning... Awaiting target's capture."
msgstr ""
"Модуль Муракумо запущено. Обмежувальний механізм знято. Криваву\n"
"Косу розгорнуто. Функція діятиме до повного знешкодження цілі..."

#. Key: RGN6_052
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ―ふざけんな！
#. JA:   おい！　お前聞こえないのか！　おい、早く逃げろ！―
#. JA: （ふざけんな！
#. JA:   　おい！　お前聞こえないのか！　おい、早く逃げろ―――！）
msgctxt "RGN6_052"
msgid "Quit screwing around! Hey, can't you hear me!? Run away already!"
msgstr "(Не смій! Гей! Ти мене не чуєш?! Швидше тікай!)"

#. Key: RGN6_053
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: キャ！
#. JA:   何！　なんなんですか貴方！
msgctxt "RGN6_053"
msgid ""
"Eek!\n"
"What...What the hell are you!?"
msgstr "Ай! Що... Що ви таке?!"

#. Key: RGN6_054
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 対象の殲滅を開始する
msgctxt "RGN6_054"
msgid "Now terminating target."
msgstr "Починаю знищення цілі."

#. Key: RGN6_055
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN6_055"
msgid "!?"
msgstr "!?"

#. Key: RGN6_056
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 動くと撃ちますよ！
#. JA:   もう一度言います！
#. JA:   止まりなさい、撃ちますよ！！！
msgctxt "RGN6_056"
msgid ""
"One more move, and I'll shoot!\n"
"This is your last warning!\n"
"Stop or I'll fire!"
msgstr ""
"Ворухнетеся — стрілятиму! Повторюю востаннє! Стійте, або я\n"
"стрілятиму!!!"

#. Key: RGN6_058
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ！？　なんなの？　なんなの？
#. JA:   どうして倒れないの！？　どうなってるの？？？
#. JA: !?　なんなの？　なんなの？
#. JA:   どうして倒れないの!?　どうなってるの？？？
msgctxt "RGN6_058"
msgid ""
"!?\n"
"What...What's going on?\n"
"How are you still standing!?"
msgstr "!? Що це? Що це таке? Чому ви не падаєте?! Що відбувається???"

#. Key: RGN6_059
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 倒れなさい！　倒れなさい！　倒れなさい！　倒れなさい！
#. JA:   倒れて、倒れてよ！！！
#. JA: 倒れなさい！　倒れなさい！
#. JA:   倒れなさい！　倒れなさい！
#. JA:   倒れて、倒れてよ！！！
msgctxt "RGN6_059"
msgid ""
"Fall! Fall! Fall! Fall! Fall!\n"
"Please...! Go down already!"
msgstr "Падайте! Падайте! Падайте! Падайте! Ну впадіть, упадіть уже!!!"

#. Key: RGN6_061
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 「グシャ」
#. JA: 女の攻撃に“俺”はひるむどころか、
#. JA:   その白い銃を奪い取り素手で握り潰した。
msgctxt "RGN6_061"
msgid ""
"Her attacks don't even faze me.\n"
"I rip the guns out of her hand and crush them."
msgstr ""
"*Хрусь!* Атаки жінки навіть не похитнули «мене». Я вихопив її білу\n"
"зброю й розчавив голою рукою."

#. Key: RGN6_062
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ベルヴェルク！……嘘……そんな……
msgctxt "RGN6_062"
msgid "Bolverk...! ...No...no way..."
msgstr "Больверк!.. Не може бути..."

#. Key: RGN6_063
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 対象の事象兵器破壊を確認・脅威レベル低下
msgctxt "RGN6_063"
msgid "Target's threat level decreased."
msgstr "Знищення Арк-Енемі цілі підтверджено. Рівень загрози знижено."

#. Key: RGN6_064
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ば……化け物……この化け物！！
msgctxt "RGN6_064"
msgid "You...monster... You monster!"
msgstr "П-потвора... Потвора!!"

#. Key: RGN6_065
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: な……？
#. JA: （な……？）
msgctxt "RGN6_065"
msgid "Ah...!?"
msgstr "Що...?"

#. Key: RGN6_066
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: イヤ！！　離しなさい！！　離しなさい！！！　離して！！！
#. JA:   キャアッ！　なに？　ひッ……お、お願い……離して……。
#. JA:   離して……ください……おねがい……グッ……！
msgctxt "RGN6_066"
msgid ""
"No! Let go of me! Right now!\n"
"Eek! Huh? *pant* P...Please...let me go...\n"
"Please...I beg you... Guh...!"
msgstr ""
"Ні!! Відпустіть!! Відпустіть мене!!! Відпустіть!!! А-а! Що? Н-ні... благаю...\n"
"відпустіть... Відпустіть... будь ласка... благаю... Кх...!"

#. Key: RGN6_067
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ★斬撃音
#. JA: 悲痛な女の声が響く。
#. JA:   次の瞬間、“俺”の右手に力が篭り、ためらいなく女の首をひねり上げた。
msgctxt "RGN6_067"
msgid ""
"I hear the girl cry in pain.\n"
"The next thing I know, I'm squeezing her neck even harder than before."
msgstr ""
"*Свист леза* Лунає сповнений болю крик жінки. Наступної миті «моя»\n"
"права рука без вагань викручує їй шию."

#. Key: RGN6_068
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 痛ッ……アッ……お願い……助けて……助けて……！！
msgctxt "RGN6_068"
msgid "Ow... Ah... Someone...please... Somebody...help me...!"
msgstr "Боляче... А-а... Благаю... допоможіть... допоможіть!!"

#. Key: RGN6_069
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 馬鹿！　やめろ！　やめろ！　やめてくれ！！！
#. JA: （馬鹿！　やめろ！　やめろ！　やめてくれ！！！）
msgctxt "RGN6_069"
msgid "No...! Stop! Stop it! Please stop!"
msgstr "(Припини! Припини! Благаю, припини!!!)"

#. Key: RGN6_070
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うおおおおおおおおおおおおお！
#. JA: （うおおおおおおおおおおおおお！）
msgctxt "RGN6_070"
msgid "AAAAARRRRRRGGGGGGHHHHH!"
msgstr "ААААААААААА!"

#. Key: RGN6_072
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 達人の剣は相手に斬られたことさえ感じさせないと、
#. JA:   俺はガキの頃に、師匠から教わった。
msgctxt "RGN6_072"
msgid ""
"My master told me once that a real swordsman can cut up his enemy and they won't\n"
"even feel it..."
msgstr ""
"Ще малим я чув від учителя: удар майстра меча не дає ворогові навіть\n"
"відчути, що його розрубали."

#. Key: RGN6_073
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: それはまさにそんな一撃だったようだ。
msgctxt "RGN6_073"
msgid "I hate to say it, but now I think I know what he meant..."
msgstr "Саме таким, схоже, й був цей удар."

#. Key: RGN6_074
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺には、斬られたという感覚が…実感がない……。
#. JA: 俺には、斬られたという感覚が……実感がない……。
msgctxt "RGN6_074"
msgid "I didn't even feel myself getting hit..."
msgstr "Я не відчував... не усвідомлював, що мене розрубали..."

#. Key: RGN6_075
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あれ？
msgctxt "RGN6_075"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Га?"

#. Key: RGN6_076
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 猫か！　邪魔をするな！
msgctxt "RGN6_076"
msgid "Grimalkin! Do not interfere!"
msgstr "Кіт! Не втручайся!"

#. Key: RGN6_077
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: すまんな、ハクメン。
#. JA:   悪いがこいつを今死なす訳にはいかないんでな。
msgctxt "RGN6_077"
msgid "I'm real sorry, Hakumen, but it ain't time for him to die just yet."
msgstr "Вибач, Хакумене. Але цьому хлопцеві ще не час помирати."

#. Key: RGN6_078
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 古き友とはいえ、容赦出来んぞ！！
msgctxt "RGN6_078"
msgid "You are an old friend and an honorable soldier, but I cannot back down! "
msgstr "Навіть старому другові я не дам пощади!!"

#. Key: RGN6_079
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ハクメンよ残念だな、時間だ……
#. JA: ハクメンよ残念だな、時間だ……。
msgctxt "RGN6_079"
msgid "Sorry, Hakumen, but I gotta do what I gotta do."
msgstr "Шкода, Хакумене, але твій час вийшов..."

#. Key: RGN6_080
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: グッ事象干渉か！
#. JA:   貴様ら……
#. JA: グッ、事象干渉か！貴様ら……。
msgctxt "RGN6_080"
msgid ""
"Do you not understand what you have done!?\n"
"A curse upon you all!"
msgstr "Кх, втручання у причинність?! Ви..."

#. Key: RGN6_081
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: バチンッ！
msgctxt "RGN6_081"
msgid "Ka-boom!"
msgstr "*Ляск!*"

#. Key: RGN6_083
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: あんた……
#. JA:   何でこんなところに！？
#. JA: あんた……
#. JA:   何でこんなところに!?
msgctxt "RGN6_083"
msgid ""
"You...\n"
"What are you doing here...?"
msgstr "Ти... Чого ти тут?!"

#. Key: RGN6_084
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺の前にいたのは、二足歩行する巨大な猫――――
#. JA:   俺の知る限り、この地上最強の生物。
#. JA:   大戦の六英雄の一人、獣兵衛だった。
#. JA: 俺の前にいたのは、二足歩行する巨大な猫―――
#. JA:   俺の知る限り、この地上最強の生物。
#. JA:   大戦の六英雄の一人、獣兵衛だった。
msgctxt "RGN6_084"
msgid ""
"There's a cat standing on its hind legs, looking at me.\n"
"I'd know that little bastard anywhere...\n"
"Jubei, the strongest living creature on earth."
msgstr ""
"Переді мною стояв велетенський кіт на двох лапах. Найсильніша,\n"
"наскільки мені відомо, істота на світі. Джюбей — один із Шістьох Героїв\n"
"Великої війни."

#. Key: RGN6_085
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ゴン！
msgctxt "RGN6_085"
msgid "Smack!"
msgstr "*Гуп!*"

#. Key: RGN6_086
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: イテっ！！
msgctxt "RGN6_086"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "Ай!!"

#. Key: RGN6_087
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おいおい、それが恩人にまず言う言葉か。
#. JA:   礼はどうした、礼は。
#. JA:   それに師匠に向かってあんたは無いだろ。
msgctxt "RGN6_087"
msgid ""
"Whoa, whoa... That the kinda thing to say to somebody what just saved your life?\n"
"How about a little thanks, kid? Would it kill ya to treat your master with a little\n"
"respect?"
msgstr ""
"Гей, хіба так насамперед звертаються до свого рятівника? Де подяка? Та\n"
"й до вчителя варто звертатися шанобливіше."

#. Key: RGN6_088
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: わりぃな……
msgctxt "RGN6_088"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Вибач..."

#. Key: RGN6_089
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ゴン！
msgctxt "RGN6_089"
msgid "Smack!"
msgstr "*Гуп!*"

#. Key: RGN6_090
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ってぇな！　何回もなぐんなよ！
msgctxt "RGN6_090"
msgid "Goddammit! Stop hitting me!"
msgstr "Боляче! Перестань битиия!"

#. Key: RGN6_091
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: そんな悪い頭の中身など、ぶちまけてしまったほうが
#. JA:   世のためかもしれないな。
msgctxt "RGN6_091"
msgid "Maybe I should just let him do you in."
msgstr "Може, для світу буде краще, якщо я розмажу вміст твоєї дурної голови."

#. Key: RGN6_092
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: いいか、ラグナ。
#. JA:   蒼の魔道書の力を、己の力と勘違いするんじゃない。
msgctxt "RGN6_092"
msgid ""
"Listen, Ragna...\n"
"Don't mistake the power of the Azure Grimoire for your own."
msgstr "Слухай, Раґно. Не плутай силу «Лазурного» гримуара зі своєю власною."

#. Key: RGN6_093
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 勘違い……だ？
msgctxt "RGN6_093"
msgid "Mistake it?"
msgstr "Плутаю...?"

#. Key: RGN6_094
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 貴様の力は何のためにある？
#. JA:   あの時お前は俺になんといった？
#. JA:   良く思い出して、そして頭を冷やせ。
#. JA: 貴様の力は何のためにある？
#. JA:   あの時お前は俺になんといった？
#. JA:   よく思い出して、そして頭を冷やせ。
msgctxt "RGN6_094"
msgid ""
"What's your strength for, kid? What did you tell me back then?\n"
"You're getting all worked up and you're losin' sight of what's really important."
msgstr ""
"Заради чого існує твоя сила? Що ти сказав мені тоді? Добре пригадай і\n"
"охолонь."

#. Key: RGN6_095
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: んだよ！　テメェら、どいつもこいつも説教くせぇんだよ！
#. JA:   俺は俺のために力を使う、いったいそれの何がわりぃ！
#. JA:   図書館を全部ぶっ潰すまで止まれねぇんだよ！
msgctxt "RGN6_095"
msgid ""
"The hell! You bastards! You all just love to lecture me, huh!?\n"
"I use my own strength for myself! What's wrong with that!?\n"
"I'm not gonna stop until I destroy the Library!"
msgstr ""
"Та що з вами всіма?! Тільки й знаєте, що читати мені нотації! Я\n"
"використовую свою силу заради себе — і що тут поганого?! Я не\n"
"зупинюся, доки не знищу всю Бібліотеку!"

#. Key: RGN6_096
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ラグナ……
#. JA: ラグナ……！
msgctxt "RGN6_096"
msgid "Ragna..."
msgstr "Раґно...!"

#. Key: RGN6_097
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ったくよ、ウサギといいアンタといい、
#. JA:   どうして俺なんかにかまうんだよ！
#. JA:   うぜぇんだよ、ちくしょう……ちくしょう……。
msgctxt "RGN6_097"
msgid ""
"God, first the rabbit and now you...\n"
"Why do all you guys harass me!?\n"
"Get out of my sight, goddammit...!"
msgstr ""
"От же ж... Спочатку Кролиця, тепер ви. Чого ви всі зі мною\n"
"панькаєтеся?! Дістали вже, чорт... чорт..."

#. Key: RGN6_098
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……きさまの憎しみは、理解しているつもりだ。
#. JA:   だからこそ手を差し伸べた。
#. JA:   たぶん、……彼女も同じだろう。
msgctxt "RGN6_098"
msgid ""
"...I understand why ya got so much hatred. That's why I helped you out. I reckon\n"
"she did the same."
msgstr ""
"...Гадаю, я розумію твою ненависть. Саме тому й простягнув тобі руку.\n"
"Мабуть... вона теж."

#. Key: RGN6_099
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
msgctxt "RGN6_099"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RGN6_100
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 今は……まだ時では無いようだな……。
msgctxt "RGN6_100"
msgid "It ain't time yet, kid..."
msgstr "Схоже... час іще не настав..."

#. Key: RGN6_101
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ラグナ、とりあえず出直せ。
#. JA:   時が来れば嫌でも、あの少女はお前の前に現れる。
msgctxt "RGN6_101"
msgid ""
"Leave this one alone, Ragna.\n"
"When the time's right, she'll be there."
msgstr ""
"Раґно, поки що повернися назад. Коли настане час, ця дівчина сама\n"
"постане перед тобою, хочеш ти того чи ні."

#. Key: RGN6_102
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: わけわかんねーよ……
#. JA:   頼むから人間語しゃべってくれ。
#. JA: わけわかんねーよ……。
#. JA:   頼むから人間語しゃべってくれ。
msgctxt "RGN6_102"
msgid ""
"I have no clue what you're talking about...\n"
"Can you speak in <DQ>human<DQ> for me?"
msgstr "Нічого не розумію... Зроби ласку, говори людською мовою."

#. Key: RGN6_103
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Jubei
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 悪いが俺は人間じゃないんでな。
msgctxt "RGN6_103"
msgid "Unfortunately, I ain't human."
msgstr "Вибач, але я не людина."

#. Key: RGN6_107
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ニャース♪　ニャース♪
#. JA:   ご飯ご飯、美味しいニャース♪
msgctxt "RGN6_107"
msgid ""
"Ooh, yay!\n"
"Free food, free food... What a day!"
msgstr "Ня♪ Ня♪ Їжа, їжа, смакота-ня♪"

#. Key: RGN6_108
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ニャッスニャス！
#. JA:   このお肉、柔らかくて肉汁た～っぷりニャスね！
msgctxt "RGN6_108"
msgid ""
"Meoow, meoooow!\n"
"This meat, it's so tender and full of juice!"
msgstr "Ня-ня! Це м’ясо таке ніжне й сокови-и-ите-ня!"

#. Key: RGN6_109
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……何で俺がここにいるんだ？
#. JA:   くそ、わけわかんねぇ……。
msgctxt "RGN6_109"
msgid ""
"...What the hell am I doing here?\n"
"Damn...I don't get it..."
msgstr "...Що я тут роблю? Чорт, нічого не розумію..."

#. Key: RGN6_110
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: つか、テメェ！　タオとか言ったな！　オマエ喰い過ぎ！
#. JA:   さっきからずーと喰ってるらしいじゃねーか！
#. JA: つか、テメェ！　タオとか言ったな！　オマエ喰い過ぎ！
#. JA:   さっきからずーと食ってるらしいじゃねーか！
msgctxt "RGN6_110"
msgid ""
"Hey, what the hell!? Tao was it!?\n"
"You eat way too much, goddammit!\n"
"You've been inhaling everything this whole time!"
msgstr ""
"А ти! Тебе ж Тао звати?! Ти забагато жереш! Кажуть, ти весь цей час\n"
"тільки й робила, що їла!"

#. Key: RGN6_111
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うるさいぞ、いい人。
#. JA:   ご飯は美味しく楽しく食べるニャスよ。
msgctxt "RGN6_111"
msgid ""
"Shut up, <DQ>good guy<DQ>!\n"
"Food is meant to be enjoyed, peacefully."
msgstr "Не галасуй, добрий чоловіче. Їжу треба їсти смачно й весело-ня."

#. Key: RGN6_112
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: テメェに注意される筋合いはねー！
msgctxt "RGN6_112"
msgid "I don't need you lecturing me!"
msgstr "Не тобі мене повчати!"

#. Key: RGN6_113
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 美味しいご飯をいっぱい食べれば嫌なことも
#. JA:   全部忘れるニャス。猫の人が言ってたニャス。
msgctxt "RGN6_113"
msgid ""
"Eat good food, and you can forget about all the bad things that happen.\n"
"The cat person told me."
msgstr ""
"Наїсися досхочу смачної їжі — і забудеш усе погане-ня. Так казав\n"
"котячий дядько."

#. Key: RGN6_114
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……チッ、まいいか。
msgctxt "RGN6_114"
msgid "Tch... Whatever."
msgstr "...Ць, нехай уже."

#. Key: RGN6_115
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: オヤジ！　俺にもおかわりだ！
#. JA:   クソッこうなったら俺も食う！　食いまくる！！
#. JA: オヤジ！　俺にもお代りだ！
#. JA:   クソッこうなったら俺も食う！　食いまくる！！
msgctxt "RGN6_115"
msgid ""
"Old man, get me another bowl, too! Dammit, if it comes down to this, I'm gonna eat\n"
"as much as I can, too!"
msgstr ""
"Дядьку! Мені теж іще порцію! Чорт, якщо вже так, то і я їстиму! Їстиму\n"
"досхочу!!"

#. Key: RGN6_117
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 美味いな、この肉まん。
msgctxt "RGN6_117"
msgid "*slurp* *gulp* This bun's not bad..."
msgstr "Смачна булочка з мʼясом."

#. Key: RGN6_118
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: その味がわかるとは、通ニャスね。
msgctxt "RGN6_118"
msgid "Oh, so you understand the taste of good food...!"
msgstr "Якщо розумієш цей смак, то ти справжній знавець-ня."

#. Key: RGN6_119
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: しかし、悪ぃな。
#. JA:   こんなにご馳走になってよ。
msgctxt "RGN6_119"
msgid "But sorry about all this. I really appreciate the food."
msgstr "І все ж вибач. Дякую, що так щедро нагодувала."

#. Key: RGN6_120
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: それはタオの台詞だぞ、いい人。
#. JA:   うにゃ、タダ飯は旨いニャスねー。
msgctxt "RGN6_120"
msgid ""
"That's my line, <DQ>good guy<DQ>.\n"
"Nothing beats free food!"
msgstr ""
"Це Тао мала сказати, добрий чоловіче. Ня-а, безплатна їжа така\n"
"смачна-ня."

#. Key: RGN6_121
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ああ、まったくだ。
#. JA:   タダ飯ほど旨ぇモンはねえよな――――ん？
#. JA: ああ、まったくだ。
#. JA:   タダ飯ほど旨ぇモンはねえよな―――ん？
msgctxt "RGN6_121"
msgid ""
"Yeah, damn straight.\n"
"Nothing really does beat—\n"
"Huh?"
msgstr "Ага, ще й як. Нема нічого смачнішого за безплатну їжу... Га?"

#. Key: RGN6_122
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 今、何か会話がかみ合ってなかったんじゃねーか？
msgctxt "RGN6_122"
msgid "Why do I feel like we were thinking the same thing?"
msgstr "Стривай, щось у нашій розмові не сходиться."

#. Key: RGN6_123
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ……おい。
#. JA:   ここの勘定。誰が払うんだ？
msgctxt "RGN6_123"
msgid ""
"...Hey. About this bill.\n"
"Who's payin' it?"
msgstr "...Гей. Хто заплатить за все це?"

#. Key: RGN6_124
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 猫の人が、いい人に払ってもらえって。
msgctxt "RGN6_124"
msgid "The cat person told me you would pay."
msgstr "Котячий дядько сказав, що заплатить добрий чоловік."

#. Key: RGN6_125
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おいおい、バカ言うんじゃねーよ。
#. JA:   俺、仕事してないの！　無職なの！　OK？
msgctxt "RGN6_125"
msgid ""
"Whoa, whoa, don't be ridiculous.\n"
"I'm not working! I'm unemployed! OK?"
msgstr "Гей, гей, не верзи дурниць. Я не працюю! Я безробітний! Зрозуміла?"

#. Key: RGN6_126
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 「ムショク」って何だ？　食い物か？
#. JA: “ムショク”って何だ？　食い物か？
msgctxt "RGN6_126"
msgid "What's <DQ>unemployed<DQ>? Does it taste good?"
msgstr "А що таке «безробітний»? Безробітний це смачно?"

#. Key: RGN6_127
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 違う違う！　いいか、よく聞けよ、タオ。
#. JA:   俺は無一文だ。お前も金なんぞ持ってない。
#. JA:   それがどういうことか、わかるか？
msgctxt "RGN6_127"
msgid ""
"No, no! All right, listen up, Tao.\n"
"I don't have a penny on me. And neither do you.\n"
"Do you know what that means?"
msgstr ""
"Ні, ні! Слухай уважно, Тао. У мене ані копійки. І в тебе грошей теж\n"
"немає. Розумієш, що це означає?"

#. Key: RGN6_128
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ほにゃ？
msgctxt "RGN6_128"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Ня?"

#. Key: RGN6_129
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 駄目だこいつ……全然わかってね―……。
#. JA: （駄目だこいつ……全然わかってね―――……）
msgctxt "RGN6_129"
msgid "You just don't get it, do ya...?"
msgstr "(Безнадійно... Вона взагалі нічого не зрозуміла...)"

#. Key: RGN6_130
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Employee
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: お客さん。
#. JA:   今の話、詳しく聞かせてもらえるアルか？
msgctxt "RGN6_130"
msgid "Sir, me no make out what you just say..."
msgstr "Пане. Можна докладніше про те, що ви щойно сказали?"

#. Key: RGN6_131
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: まあ。
msgctxt "RGN6_131"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr "Ну..."

#. Key: RGN6_132
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: その。
msgctxt "RGN6_132"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr "Тобто..."

#. Key: RGN6_133
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なんだ。
msgctxt "RGN6_133"
msgid "Y'know..."
msgstr "Як би це..."

#. Key: RGN6_135
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 逃げるぞタオ！！
msgctxt "RGN6_135"
msgid "Run for it, Tao!"
msgstr "Тікаємо, Тао!!"

#. Key: RGN6_136
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ま、まだご飯が残ってるニャスよー！！
msgctxt "RGN6_136"
msgid "B-But there's still some food left!"
msgstr "А-але їжа ще залишилася-ня!!"

#. Key: RGN6_137
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: くせー飯食うハメになりたくなきゃ、走れ！！
#. JA:   つかこんな事で捕まったら……。
#. JA:   ヤベェ、マジ笑えねぇ……！
msgctxt "RGN6_137"
msgid ""
"If you don't wanna eat crap everyday for lunch, run!\n"
"I don't even wanna think about what'll happen if they catch me...\n"
"Ah, that's not even funny..."
msgstr ""
"Якщо не хочеш жерти смердючу баланду — біжи!! Якщо мене схоплять\n"
"через таку дурню... Паскудство, тут уже не до сміху...!"

#. Key: RGN6_138
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 臭くてもご飯はご飯ニャスー！
#. JA:   あーん、タオの肉まんー！！
msgctxt "RGN6_138"
msgid ""
"Even if it's crap, food is food!\n"
"Ahh, my steamed bun!"
msgstr "Навіть смердюча їжа — це їжа-ня! А-а, м’ясна булочка Тао!!"

#. Key: RGN6_139
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Employee
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ちょっとお客さん！
#. JA:   く、食い逃げよー！！　誰かー！！
msgctxt "RGN6_139"
msgid ""
"S-Sir!\n"
"The bill! You no dine and dash!"
msgstr "Стійте, пане клієнте! В-вони тікають, не заплативши! Хто-небудь!!"

#. Key: RGN6_140
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Customer A
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おい。今の、例の賞金首じゃないか？
msgctxt "RGN6_140"
msgid "Hey. Isn't that...the bounty?"
msgstr "Гей. Це ж не той розшукуваний злочинець?"

#. Key: RGN6_141
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Customer B
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: マジか！　手配書とはちょっと顔が違ったが、
#. JA:   言われてみれば特徴がそのままだな！
msgctxt "RGN6_141"
msgid ""
"Are you serious? Now that I think about it...\n"
"He looks a little different from the poster,\n"
"but I can see the resemblance."
msgstr ""
"Серйозно?! Обличчя трохи не таке, як на оголошенні, але тепер бачу: всі\n"
"прикмети збігаються!"

#. Key: RGN6_142
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ちょっとじゃねーだろ全然違うだろうが！！！
#. JA:   ってなに突っ込んでだ俺は！
msgctxt "RGN6_142"
msgid "What do you mean a <DQ>little<DQ> different!?"
msgstr "Не «трохи» — воно геть інше!!! І нащо я взагалі це виправляю?!"

#. Key: RGN6_143
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Customer C
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 「死神」が食い逃げだってよ？
msgctxt "RGN6_143"
msgid "Hey, you hear Ragna dined and dashed?"
msgstr "Чули? «Жнець» утік, не заплативши!"

#. Key: RGN6_144
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Customer D
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 追おうぜ！　全員でかかれば捕まえられるかもしれねえ！
msgctxt "RGN6_144"
msgid "Let's get him! If we all attack, we might be able to take him down!"
msgstr "За ним! Якщо навалимося всі разом, то, може, схопимо!"

#. Key: RGN6_145
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Customer E
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 賞金、山分けでもこりゃ美味しいぜ！！
msgctxt "RGN6_145"
msgid "We can split the bounty!"
msgstr "Навіть якщо поділимо нагороду, нам добряче перепаде!!"

#. Key: RGN6_146
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: おいおい。
#. JA:   店の中は咎追いだらけだったってか。
#. JA:   冗談じゃねーぜ。
msgctxt "RGN6_146"
msgid "Hey. You mean this place was full of bounty hunters? What the hell!?"
msgstr "Та ви знущаєтеся. У ресторані самі мисливці за головами?"

#. Key: RGN6_147
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 食い逃げなんぞで捕まったら、
#. JA:   生き恥さらすなんてもんじゃねー！
msgctxt "RGN6_147"
msgid ""
"After all I've done, I'll be a laughing stock for the rest of my life if I get caught for\n"
"dine and dashing!"
msgstr ""
"Якщо мене схоплять за те, що не заплатив у ресторані, це буде не просто\n"
"ганьба на все життя!"

#. Key: RGN6_148
#. Source: story/storytext_ex00 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex00.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex01 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex01.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex02 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex02.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex03 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex03.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex04 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex04.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_ex05 (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_ex05.pac)
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 捕まってたまるかよ！！
msgctxt "RGN6_148"
msgid "I'm not going down!"
msgstr "Не дам себе схопити!!"

#. Key: RGN0_164
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 甲高い笑い声を上げながら、一人の男が姿を現した。
msgctxt "RGN0_164"
msgid "The silhouette of a man slowly comes into view."
msgstr "Поволі вимальовується силует чоловіка."

#. Key: RGN2_008a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 貴様から蒼、蒼の色を感じる。
msgctxt "RGN2_008a"
msgid "I can sense...the power of the Azure from you..."
msgstr "Я відчуваю... в тобі силу Лазурі..."

#. Key: RGN2_010a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 蒼！　蒼！　蒼！
#. JA:   欲しい！！　狂わしく！　欲する！！　ケヒャヒャヒャヒャ！
msgctxt "RGN2_010a"
msgid ""
"Azure! Azure! Azure!\n"
"I want it! I must have it! Gehyahyahyah!"
msgstr "Лазур! Лазур! Лазур! Я хочу її! Вона мусить бути моєю! Ґех'я-х'я-х'я!"

#. Key: RGN2_012a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: その力！　奪う！　必然！
msgctxt "RGN2_012a"
msgid "That power! I must possess it! Now!"
msgstr "Ця сила! Я мушу нею заволодіти! Негайно!"

#. Key: RGN2_018a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: うううううう！
#. JA:   蒼！蒼！……欲する！
msgctxt "RGN2_018a"
msgid ""
"Ugh...augh...oogh\n"
"Azure...! Azure...! I need It..."
msgstr "Кх... ах... у-у Лазур...! Лазур...! Вона мені потрібна..."

#. Key: RGN2_036a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 蒼が……蒼が滾る……力が、グフ、グフ……グプププ
msgctxt "RGN2_036a"
msgid ""
"Azure...the Azure...! I finally have its power!\n"
"...Geheh...pffahahaha!"
msgstr "Лазур... Лазур...! Нарешті її сила моя! ...Ґехе... пф-ха-ха-ха!"

#. Key: RGN2_039a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: これが、これが蒼の力、我が求めし蒼の理。
#. JA:   キ――――――――――ヒヒヒ
msgctxt "RGN2_039a"
msgid ""
"This...this is it! The Azure that I wanted...\n"
"Keeeeeeheeheehee!"
msgstr "Це... це вона! Лазур, якої я прагнув... Кі-і-і-і-і-хі-хі-хі!"

#. Key: RGN2_139
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: その時、突如見知らぬ女が側に駆け寄ってきた。
msgctxt "RGN2_139"
msgid "Suddenly, some chick jumps out into the picture."
msgstr "Раптом у поле зору вистрибує якась дівчина."

#. Key: RGN2_140
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: なぜこんなところに女が……と思ったが、尋ねる余裕などない。
msgctxt "RGN2_140"
msgid ""
"I was curious what a chick like her was doing here...\n"
"But I hardly had the time to ask."
msgstr ""
"Мені цікаво, що така дівчина тут робить... Та часу запитувати майже\n"
"немає."

#. Key: RGN2_043a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: キ――――――――――――――ヒヒヒ
#. JA:   蒼！蒼！蒼！蒼！！！
msgctxt "RGN2_043a"
msgid ""
"Keeeeeeeeeeeeheeheeheehee!\n"
"Azure. Azure! Azure! Azure!"
msgstr "Кі-і-і-і-і-і-і-хі-хі-хі-хі! Лазур. Лазур! Лазур! Лазур!"

#. Key: RGN3_097_0
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Taochel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: もうすぐここに白くてバカっぽそうなのが来るから
#. JA:   お願いしてみるといいわ。
msgctxt "RGN3_097_0"
msgid "A foolish, white-haired gentlemen will be by here shortly. You should try asking him."
msgstr ""
"Незабаром тут проходитиме дурнуватий білявий пан. Спробуй попросити\n"
"його."

#. Key: RGN3_097_1
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: もうすぐここに白くてバカっぽそうなのが来るから
#. JA:   お願いしてみるといいわ。
msgctxt "RGN3_097_1"
msgid ""
"<DQ>A stupid-looking white guy's gonna pass by soon...\n"
"You should try asking him.<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"«Скоро тут проходитиме дурнуватий білявець... Спробуй попросити\n"
"його.»"

#. Key: RGN3_097_2
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: もうすぐここに白くてバカっぽそうなのが来るから
#. JA:   お願いしてみるといいわ。
msgctxt "RGN3_097_2"
msgid "A foolish, white-haired gentlemen will be by here shortly. You should try asking him."
msgstr ""
"Незабаром тут проходитиме дурнуватий білявий пан. Спробуй попросити\n"
"його."

#. Key: RGN3_098_0
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Taochel
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: まぁ、見た目は貧相だけれど、
#. JA:   鼻の下を伸ばして瀕死の化け物を見逃してあげる
#. JA:   “いい人”だから。貴方の願い、叶えてくれるわよ。
msgctxt "RGN3_098_0"
msgid ""
"He looks rather poor, but he was kind enough to let a monster roam free, so I\n"
"suppose he's a <DQ>good guy<DQ> by anyone's definition of the word."
msgstr ""
"Він виглядає бідним, але був досить добрим, щоб відпустити чудовисько,\n"
"тож за будь-якими мірками він «добрий чоловік»."

#. Key: RGN3_098_1
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Taokaka
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: まぁ、見た目は貧相だけれど、
#. JA:   鼻の下を伸ばして瀕死の化け物を見逃してあげる
#. JA:   “いい人”だから。貴方の願い、叶えてくれるわよ。
msgctxt "RGN3_098_1"
msgid ""
"<DQ>Well, he does look pretty poor, but he was kind enough to let a monster roam free,\n"
"so I'm sure he's a <DQ>good guy<DQ> by anyone's definition of the word.<DQ>"
msgstr ""
"«Виглядає він бідно, але був досить добрим, щоб відпустити чудовисько,\n"
"тож за будь-якими мірками він »добрий чоловік«.»"

#. Key: RGN6_000
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 俺は動き始めた「窯」に向かって慎重に足を進めた。
#. JA:   いつも通りなら、ここから「やつ」が出てくるはずだ―――。
#. JA:   数歩を歩いたところで、唐突に背中に鈍い痛みが走った。
msgctxt "RGN6_000"
msgid ""
"As usual, I'm going for the <DQ>Cauldron<DQ>.\n"
"I carefully stepped in... I didn't sense anyone, but...\n"
"Something didn't feel right... Pain...?"
msgstr ""
"Я обережно рушив до Котла, що вже почав працювати. Якщо все піде як\n"
"завжди, звідти має з’явитися «вона»... Та за кілька кроків спину раптом\n"
"пронизав тупий біль."

#. Key: RGN6_214
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: グハッ……テメェ！
msgctxt "RGN6_214"
msgid "Gargh!... You bastard!"
msgstr "Ґах... Ти, паскудо!"

#. Key: RGN6_215
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 何も変えられない。何も。
msgctxt "RGN6_215"
msgid "You can't change anything. Nothing at all."
msgstr "Ти нічого не зміниш. Нічого."

#. Key: RGN6_216
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: テメェ、放しやが―――
#. JA:   なん……だ……ちからが……はいらねぇ……。
msgctxt "RGN6_216"
msgid ""
"Damn you, let go of— Aaahgh!\n"
"Wha...t...my power...is fading..."
msgstr "Ти... відпусти мене... Що... таке... сил немає..."

#. Key: RGN6_217
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ふふふふふ……
msgctxt "RGN6_217"
msgid "*chuckle*"
msgstr "Хи-хи-хи-хи..."

#. Key: RGN6_218
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: やめろ……おれ……は……。
msgctxt "RGN6_218"
msgid "Stop it... I'm...not..."
msgstr "Припини... я..."

#. Key: RGN6_219
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 貴様！　兄さんを、兄さんを放せ！！
msgctxt "RGN6_219"
msgid "You bastard! Let go... Let go of my brother!"
msgstr "Ти! Відпусти... відпусти мого брата!!"

#. Key: RGN6_220
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: ジン……か？
#. JA:   ……ばかが……くんじゃ……ねーよ……。
#. JA:   にげろ……。
msgctxt "RGN6_220"
msgid ""
"Jin...is that you...?\n"
"...Stupid...don't...come...\n"
"Run..."
msgstr "Джіне... це ти? ...Дурню... не підходь... Тікай..."

#. Key: RGN6_264
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrg (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrg.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Ragna story route (POV: Ragna)
#. JA: 怯え、涙ぐむ女の首筋を“俺”の右手が無造作に掴む。
msgctxt "RGN6_264"
msgid ""
"The girl is trembling in fear, but against my will, I reach out with my right hand\n"
"and grab her neck."
msgstr ""
"«Моя» права рука недбало хапає за шию перелякану дівчину, в чиїх очах\n"
"бринять сльози."
